uing to carry out any of those services as an employee of the relevant person;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li2640\tqr\tx2400\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2640\cf1 \f0 (ii)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2640\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2640\cf1 \f0 the relevant individual shall be treated as an employee of the relevant person, and the relevant person shall be treated as the employer of the relevant individual, whilst the relevant individual is treated, under paragraph (i), as having an employment of profit with the relevant person; and \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li2640\tqr\tx2400\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2640\cf1 \f0 (iii)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2640\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2640\cf1 \f0 any such remuneration shall be treated as being\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li2160\tqr\tx1920\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 (A)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 income derived by the relevant individual from an employment of profit with the relevant person; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li2160\tqr\tx1920\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 (B)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 received by and accrued to the relevant individual at the time that it is paid or credited to the corporation or trustee concerned referred to in paragraph (a), (b) or (c),\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\li1200\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 and the other provisions of this Ordinance (including }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22