er or not the agreement refers to that undertaking) provides for any remuneration for any of those services to include or to be the provision of annual leave, passage allowance, sick leave, pension entitlements, medical payments or accommodation, or any similar benefit, or any benefit (including money) in lieu thereof;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 if the agreement referred to in that subsection or any related undertaking (and whether or not the agreement refers to that undertaking) requires any of the services referred to in that subsection to be carried out personally by the relevant individual, the relevant individual carries out the same or similar services\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li2160\tqr\tx1920\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 (i)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 for persons other than any person for whom those first-mentioned services are carried out under that agreement; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li2160\tqr\tx1920\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 (ii)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 during the term of that agreement or undertaking, as the case may be;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (c)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 the performance by the relevant individual of any of those services is not subject to