80\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 an allowance under }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 Part 6}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0  is or has been granted to a relevant person in respect of any capital expenditure incurred on the provision of the aircraft;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (c)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 capital allowances are granted to a relevant person in a jurisdiction outside Hong Kong (}{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 non-Hong Kong jurisdiction}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 ), for the year of assessment, in respect of any capital expenditure incurred on the provision of the aircraft;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (d)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 subject to subsection (7), the qualifying aircraft leasing activity is carried out by the corporation as an owner of the aircraft and, before the aircraft is acquired by the corporation\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li2160\tqr\tx1920\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 (i)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 the aircraft was owned and used by a lessee of the operating lease to which the qualifying aircraft leasing activity relates (}{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 lessee}{\