1200\cf1 \f0 (1)(b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 , an allowance under }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Part 6}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  is to be regarded as not being or having been granted to a relevant person in respect of any capital expenditure incurred on the provision of the specified aircraft if an amount equal to the allowance has been charged to profits tax as balancing charge made on the relevant person.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (4)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Subsection }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (1)(c)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  does not apply to capital allowances granted to a relevant person in a non-Hong Kong jurisdiction (as described in that subsection) if Condition 1 or Condition 2 is satisfied in relation to the year of assessment.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (5)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Condition 1 is that\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 the relevant person is subject to tax in the non-Hong Kong jurisdiction (}{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 non-Hong Kong tax}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 ) in respect of the gross lease payments for the right to use the specified aircraft in relation to the year of asse