osupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 which is sold or transferred for valuable consideration to a person who carries on or intends to carry on a trade or business in Hong Kong; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li2160\tqr\tx1920\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 (ii)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 the cost whereof may be deducted by the purchaser as an expense in computing the profits from such trade or business in respect of which such purchaser is chargeable to tax under this Part,\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\li1680\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 the value thereof shall be taken to be the amount realized on the sale or the value of the consideration given for the transfer;}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0  }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (Amended }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 28 of 1964 s. 6}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 )\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 in the case of any other such trading stock, the value thereof shall be taken to be the amount which it would have realized if it had been sold in the open market at the date of cessation.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i\fs22\qr\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qr\qr\li720\cf1 \f0 (Added }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qr\qr\li720\cf1 \f0 36 of 1955 s. 22}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qr\qr\li720\cf1 \f0 . Amended }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qr\qr\li720\cf1 \f0 7 of 1986 s. 12}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qr\qr\li720\cf1 \f0 )\par }}
