 person by way of legal fees, procuration fees, stamp duties and other expenses in connection with such borrowing; }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (Replaced }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 2 of 1971 s. 11}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 . Amended }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 36 of 1984 s. 4}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 ; }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 12 of 2004 s. 6}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 ; }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 12 of 2016 s. 8}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 )\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 rent paid by any tenant of land or buildings occupied by him for the purpose of producing such profits, but not exceeding, in the case of rent paid to the tenant\u8217??s spouse, or by a partnership to one or more of the partners thereof or to a spouse of any such partner, an amount equal to the assessable value of the land or buildings; }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (Amended }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 76 of 1975 s. 8}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 ; }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 8 of 1983 s. 11}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 ; }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 71 of 1983 s. 14}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 )\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (c)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub