0 (Amended }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qr\qr\li720\cf1 \f0 21 of 2011 s. 5}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qr\qr\li720\cf1 \f0 )\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (5)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 In this section, a reference to the purchase or sale of rights of a kind referred to in subsection (1) includes a reference to the purchase or sale of a share or interest in any such rights.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (Added }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 15 of 1992 s. 2}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 )\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (6)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 The amendments made to this section by the Inland Revenue (Amendment) Ordinance 1992 (}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 15 of 1992}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ) apply to patent rights or rights to any know-how purchased under contracts entered into on or after 18 April 1991 and the provisions of this section that were in force immediately before the commencement of that Ordinance continue to apply to patent rights or rights to any trade mark or design purchased under contracts entered into before 18 April 1991 and also to proceeds received from the sale of those rights whether before or after 18 April 1991 as if the amendments had not been enacted.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (Added }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 15 of 1992 s. 2}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 )\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (7)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 If any rights of a kind referred to in subsection (1) are purchased or sold together or with any other assets for one consideration, the Commissioner may, for the purposes of the calculation of the deduction under subsection (1) or the calculation of the trading receipt under subsection (3), and having regard to all the circumstances of the transaction, allocate a consideration for the purchase or sale of each individual asset.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (Added }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 21 of 2011 s. 5}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 )\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (8)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 For the purposes of this section, if the Commissioner is of the opinion that the consideration for the purchase or sale of any rights of a kind referred to in subsection (1) does not represent the true market value of those rights at the time of that purchase or sale, the Commissioner may determine the true market value, and the amount so determined is to be treated\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 for the purposes of subsection (1), as the capital expenditure incurred on purchase; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 for the purposes of subsection (3), as the proceeds of sale, and a reference to relevant proceeds of sale is to be construed accordingly.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0  }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (Added }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 21 of 2011 s. 5}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 )\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (9)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 To avoid doubt, any expenditure incurred on the acquisition of a licence (as defined by }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 section 16EC(8)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ) of any rights of a kind referred to in subsection (1) is not deductible under that subsection.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (Added }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 21 of 2011 s. 5}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 )\par }}
