cf1 \f0 benefits under the trust estate; or\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li2160\tqr\tx1920\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 (ii)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 not being a trustee of the trust estate or, if the trustee is a corporation, a director of the trustee\u8212??is able (or might reasonably be expected to be able) to control the activities of the trust estate or the application of its corpus or income,\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\li1680\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 otherwise than through the other person; or\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (d)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 where the other person is an entity that does not fall within any of paragraphs (a), (b) and (c)\u8212??the person has any of the ownership interests in the entity.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (5)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 A person (}{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 the person}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ) is to be regarded as having an indirect beneficial interest in another person (}{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 the other person}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ) if\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 where the other person is a corporation that is not a trustee of a trust estate\u8212??the person is interested in any of the issued share capital (however described) of the corporation;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 where the other person is a partnership that is not a trustee of a trust estate\u8212??the person is entitled to any of the profits of the partnership;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (c)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 where the other person is a trustee of a trust estate, the person\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li2160\tqr\tx1920\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 (i)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 benefits under the trust estate; or\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li2160\tqr\tx1920\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 (ii)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 not being a trustee of the trust estate or, if the trustee is a corporation, a director of the trustee\u8212??is able (or might reasonably be expected to be able) to control the activities of the trust estate or the application of its corpus or income; or\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (d)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 where the other person is an entity that does not fall within any of paragraphs (a), (b) and (c)\u8212??the person has any of the ownership interests in the entity,\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\li1200\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 through a third person (}{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 interposed person}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ), or through a series of 2 or more interposed persons, who is or are related to the person and the other person in the way described in subsections (6) and (7).\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (6)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 If there is one interposed person\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 the person has a direct beneficial interest in the interposed person; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 the interposed person has a direct beneficial interest in the other person.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (7)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 If there is a series of 2 or more interposed persons\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 the person has a direct beneficial interest in the first interposed person in the series;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 each interposed person (other than the last interposed person) in the series has a direct beneficial interest in the next interposed person in the series; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (c)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 the last interposed person in the series has a direct beneficial interest in the other person.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (8)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 If the partners in a partnership are not entitled to its profits but are only entitled to a distribution of its assets on its dissolution\u8212??a reference to an entitlement to the profits of a partnership is taken to be a reference to an entitlement to a distribution of the assets of the partnership on its dissolution.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (9)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 A reference to the issued share capital of a corporation does not include the shares comprised in the issued share capital that do not entitle their holders to receive dividends (whether in cash or in kind) and a distribution of the corporation\u8217??s assets on its dissolution other than a return of capital.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i\fs22\qr\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qr\qr\li720\cf1 \f0 (Added }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qr\qr\li720\cf1 \f0 5 of 2019 s. 6}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qr\qr\li720\cf1 \f0 )\par }}
