 profits. Where no active partner is resident in Hong Kong the return shall be furnished by the manager or agent of the partnership in Hong Kong.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (Amended }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 7 of 1986 s. 12}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 )\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (2A)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 The general partner in a limited partnership fund must make and deliver a statement of the profits or losses of such trade, profession or business, on behalf of the fund, ascertained in accordance with the provisions of this Part relating to the ascertainment of profits. }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (Added }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 14 of 2020 s. 108}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 )\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (2B)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 For the purposes of subsection (2A), if a limited partnership fund has an authorized representative, the reference to the general partner in the fund in that subsection is a reference to the authorized representative. }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (Added }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 14 of 2020 s. 108}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 )\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (3)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 If a change occurs in a partnership of persons carrying on any trade, profession or business, by reason of retirement or death, or the dissolution of the partnership as to one or more of the partners, or the admission of a new partner, in such circumstances that one or more of the persons who until that time were engaged in the trade, profession or business continue to be engaged therein, or if a person previously engaged in any trade, profession or business on his own account continues to be engaged in it, but as a partner in a partnership, the tax payable by the person or persons who carry on the trade, profession or business after that time shall, notwithstanding the change be computed on what would otherwise have been the assessable profits of such person or persons or the aggregation of such assessable profits as if no such change had occurred.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (Amended }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 30 of 1950 }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Schedule; }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 36 of 1955 s. 31}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ; }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 49 of 1956 s. 18}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ; }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 7 of 1975 s. 19}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ; }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 56 of 1993 s. 16}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 )\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (4)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Tax upon the partnership shall be recoverable by all means provided in this Ordinance out of the assets of the partnership, or from any partner.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (Amended }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 36 of 1955 s. 31}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 )\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (5)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Tax may be assessed on the profits of a}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 partnership notwithstanding the cessation or dissolution of such partnership and shall be recoverable from the former partners and from the assets of the partnership at the time of its cessation.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (6)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 In this section\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-480\li1200\sl260{{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 authorized representative}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  (}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f13\u29554??\u25480??\u27402??\u20195??\u34920??}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ) has the meaning given by }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 section 2}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  of the Limited Partnership Fund Ordinance (}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Cap. 637}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ); }{\b0\i\no