)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 the remainder of the definition }{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 relevant charter hire}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0  in subsection (5) shall apply as though in that definition the words \u8220??outside an arrangement territory\u8221?? were substituted for the words \u8220??outside Hong Kong\u8221??.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0  }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (Added }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 19 of 1996 s. 7}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 )\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (2C)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 The provisions relating to paragraph (a) of the definition }{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 relevant charter hire}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  in subsection (2B) shall not be construed so as to exclude from the definition }{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 relevant sums}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  in subsection (5), any sum derived from, or attributable to, or in respect of any charter hire in respect of the operation of an aircraft flying between aerodromes or airports within Hong Kong.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (Added }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 19 of 1996 s. 7}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 )\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (2D)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Subsection (2A) shall not apply to any sums derived from, attributable to, or in respect of any relevant carriage shipped in an arrangement territory and any relevant charter hire attributable to an arrangement territory where such sums are chargeable to tax in an arrangement territory.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (Added }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 19 of 1996 s. 7}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 )\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (3)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 For the purposes of this section, any sums earned by or accrued to the owner of an aircraft under a charter-party (whether by demise or not) that does not, or does not purport to, extent to the whole of that aircraft shall, to the extent that those sums are derived from, attributable to, or in respect of, any outward flight or flights of that aircraft commencing from any aerodrome or airport within Hong Kong, be deemed to be derived from, attributable to, or in respect of, any relevant carriage shipped in Hong Kong. \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (4)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 For the purposes of this section, the following sums earned by or accrued to an owner of aircraft under a charter-party otherwise than by demise shall be deemed to be derived from, attributable to, or in respect of, any relevant carriage shipped in Hong Kong\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 in the case of a charter-party which is a flight charter, any sums earned by or accrued to that owner under that charter-party and derived from, attributable to, or in respect of, any outward flight or flights of that aircraft commencing from any aerodrome or airport within Hong Kong; \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 in the case of a charter-party which is a time charter, the sum bearing the same ratio to the aggregate of the sums earned by or accrued to that owner under that charter-party as the total number of flying hours of that aircraft flown in respect of all outward flights of that aircraft commencing from any aerodrome or airport within Hong Kong to the final destinations of those flights bear to the aggregate of the total number of flying hours of that aircraft flown in respect of all flights of that aircraft under that charter-party. \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (5)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 In this section\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-480\li1200\sl260{{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 aerodrome or airport}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  (}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f13\u27231??\u22378??\u25110??\u39131??\u27231??\u22580??}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ) includes any helipad; \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-480\li1200\sl260{{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 air waybill}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  (}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f13\u31354??\u36939??\u36335??\u21934??}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ) has the same meaning as in the Import and Export Ordinance (}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Cap. 60}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ), but does not include an air waybill which describes any aerodrome or airport in Hong Kong as the aerodrome or airport of departure or the aerodrome or airport of destination; \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-480\li1200\sl260{{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 aircraft}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  (}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f13\u39131??\u27231??}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ) includes a helicopter; \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-480\li1200\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 *}{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 arrangement territory}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  (}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f13\u23433??\u25490??\u22320??\u21312??}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ), in relation to an arrangement for the relief of double taxation, means any territory outside Hong Kong where an arrangement for the relief of double taxation has effect by virtue of }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 section 49}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  in respect of any person of the description mentioned in subsection (1), deemed to be carrying on a business as an owner of aircraft in Hong Kong;}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs2