se persons entitled to vote at a general meeting of the club, or similar institution, or trade, professional or business association.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (Replaced }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 36 of 1955 s. 34}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 . Amended }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 40 of 1972 s. 3}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 )\par }}
