\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  and }{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 UTPR top-up tax}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  respectively.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (3)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Part 3 of Schedule 61}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  provides for various transitional and permanent safe harbours in relation to the implementation of the GloBE rules.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (4)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Schedule 62}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  has effect for charging a domestic minimum top-up tax within the meaning of the OECD GloBE model rules, to be called the }{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Hong Kong minimum top-up tax}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  or }{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 HKMTT}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 .\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (5)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Schedule 63}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  contains the provisions on the administration of the IIR top-up tax, UTPR top-up tax and HKMTT including\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 requirements for the filing of returns and notices and provision of information relevant to the determination of liability for any top-up tax; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 provisions that disapply provisions of this Ordinance in relation to any top-up taxes or modify them in their application in relation to any top-up tax.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (6)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 The IIR top-up tax is payable in relation to a fiscal year beginning on or after 1 January 2025.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (7)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 The UTPR top-up tax is payable in relation to a fiscal year beginning on or after a date specified by the Secretary for Financial Services and the Treasury by notice published in the Gazette.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (8)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 The HKMTT is payable in relation to a fiscal year beginning on or after 1 January 2025.\par }}
