e expenses described in that subsection have been paid by the person or his or her spouse in respect of that parent or grandparent.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (3)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 A deduction allowable to a person under subsection (1) in respect of each parent or grandparent of the person for any year of assessment shall not exceed the amount specified in }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Schedule 3C}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  in relation to that year of assessment.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1680\li1680\tqr\tx960\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (4)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 Subject to paragraph (b), a deduction in respect of any residential care expenses shall not be allowable under this section to more than one person for any year of assessment in respect of the same parent or grandparent.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 Where a deduction in respect of any residential care expenses is claimed by or allowed to more than one person for any year of assessment in respect of the same parent or grandparent, }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 section 33(2)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0  to (4) shall apply with the necessary modification