\li720\cf1 \f0 E.R. 1 of 2012}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qr\qr\li720\cf1 \f0 )\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa0\li720{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f1 _____________________\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa0\li720{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f1 Editorial Note:\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs2\qj\sb0\sa0\fi0\li720\sl20{\par}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs2\qj\sb0\sa0\fi0\li720\sl20{{\pard\intbl\ltrch\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\intbl\fs18\ql\sb0\sa0{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\ql\ql\cf1 \f0 *}}{\cell}\pard\intbl\ltrch\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\intbl\fs18\qj\sb0\sa0{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\cf1 \f1 The amendment made to this }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\cf1 \f1 section 37A(4)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\cf1 \f1  by }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\cf1 \f1 9 of 2004 }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\cf1 \f1 applies in relation to the year of assessment commencing on 1 April 2004 and to all subsequent years of assessment. (Please see }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\cf1 \f1 9 of 2004 s. 1}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\cf1 \f1 (2))}}{\cell}{
