owances computed in accordance with }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 section 37}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0  in respect of any machinery or plant belonging to that class;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (c)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 the aggregate of any initial allowances computed in accordance with this section in respect of any machinery or plant belonging to that class;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (d)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 any annual allowance computed in accordance with this section;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (e)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 any sale, insurance, salvage or compensation moneys received in respect of any machinery or plant belonging to that class; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (f)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 any reducing value of machinery or plant excluded from the total reducing value of a class of machinery or plant under }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 section 39C(3)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 .\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (5)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Where, prior to the commencement of the Inland Revenue (Amendment)(No. 4) Ordinance 1980 (}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 63 of 1980}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ), any machinery or plant has been the subject of a balancing allowance or balancing charge computed in accordance with }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 section 38}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 , such machinery or plant shall, for the purposes of subsection (4), be excluded from the class of machinery or plant. \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (6)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Where any machinery or plant is owned and used by a person for any period immediately before he uses it for the purposes of producing profits chargeable to tax under }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Part 4}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 , the capital expenditure incurred on the provision of the machinery or plant for the purposes of subsection (4) shall be computed by deducting from the actual cost the notional amount of the annual allowances which would have been made under }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 section 37}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  to the owner if since acquiring the machinery or plant he had used it for the purpose of producing profits chargeable to tax under }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Part 4}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 .\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{