 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 in respect of machinery or plant to which }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 section 39A}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0  applies.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (2)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Where, pursuant to the terms and conditions of a hire purchase agreement, machinery or plant to which }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 section 37A}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  applies passes into the ownership of the person carrying on a trade, profession or business who incurred the capital expenditure under the hire purchase agreement, the reducing value of such machinery or plant computed in accordance with that section shall be included in the class of machinery or plant for the purposes of }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 section 39B}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  for the years of assessment following the year of assessment during the basis period for which the machinery or plant passed into the ownership of that person.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (3)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Where any machinery or plant which is included in a class of machinery or plant for the purposes of }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 section 39B}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  and which was used wholly and exclusively in the production of profits chargeable to tax under }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Part 4}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  is subsequently not so used wholly and exclusively in the production of such profits, the provisions of this Part which applied immediately prior to the commencement of the Inland Revenue (Amendment) (No. 4) Ordinance 1980 (}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 63 of 1980}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ) shall apply to such machinery or plant in respect of the year of assessment during the basis period for which the machinery or plant is subsequently not used wholly and exclusively in the production of profits chargeable to tax under }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Part 4}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 , and the reducing value of such machinery or plant shall be deemed to be such an amount as the Commissioner may consider it would have realized had it been sold in the open market at the time it ceased to be used wholly and exclusively in the production of such profits, and such reducing value shall be excluded from the total reducing value of that class of machinery or plant.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (4)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 For the purposes of subsection (2), in the application of }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 section 37A}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 , subsection (2) of that section shall be read as if \u8220??during the basis period\u8221?? was substituted for \u8220??at the end of the basis period\u8221??.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i\fs22\qr\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qr\qr\li720\cf1 \f0 (Added }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qr\qr\li720\cf1 \f0 63 of 1980 s. 3}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qr\qr\li720\cf1 \f0 . Amended }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qr\qr\li720\cf1 \f0 E.R. 1 of 2012}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qr\qr\li720\cf1 \f0 )\par }}
