b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 such deductions as are under }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 Part 4A}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0  allowable to the individual; and }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (Replaced }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 31 of 1998 s. 18}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 )\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 the amount of the individual\u8217??s loss or share of loss for that year of assessment computed in accordance with }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 Part 4}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 .\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (3)-(4)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (Repealed }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 31 of 1998 s. 18}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 )\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1680\li1680\tqr\tx960\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (5)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 Where in any year of assessment the aggregate amount of the deductions under subsection }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (2)(a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0  and the loss under subsection }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (2)(b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0  for an individual exceeds the total income of the individual\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li2160\tqr\tx1920\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 (i)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 subject to subparagraph (ii), that part of the amount of such excess not exceeding the amount of the loss under subsection }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 (2)(b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0  for the individual for that year of assessment shall be carried forward to be set off against the total income of the individual for future years of assessment;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li2160\tqr\tx1920\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 (ii)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 where the total incomes of the individual and his or her spouse are required to be aggregated under }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 section 42A(1)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 , the amount of such excess shall be reduced as far as can be done by being set off against the total income of his or her spouse for that year of assessment as reduced under subsection (2), and that part of the amount of such excess not exceeding the amount of the loss under subsection }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 (2)(b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0  for the individual for that year of assessment which is not so reduced shall be carried forward to be set off 