sub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (3)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 The Commissioner may request the taxpayer\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 to pay any costs and reasonable expenses incurred by the Commissioner in relation to the mutual agreement procedure and, if an issue in the case is further referred for arbitration, in relation to the arbitration; or\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 to reimburse the Commissioner for the costs and expenses.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (4)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Any amount payable or reimbursable under subsection (3) is recoverable as a civil debt due to the Government.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (5)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Subsection (6) applies if, for a case presented for mutual agreement procedure\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 the Commissioner arrives at a solution unilaterally;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 the competent authorities of Hong Kong and the DTA territory reach a mutual agreement; or\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (c)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 after the case or an issue in the case is referred for arbitration\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li2160\tqr\tx1920\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 (i)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 a solution is arrived at by the Commissioner unilaterally, or a mutual agreement is reached between the competent authorities of Hong Kong and the DTA territory, before a decision is delivered by the arbitrators; or\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li2160\tqr\tx1920\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 (ii)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 a decision is delivered by the arbitrators.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (6)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 The Commissioner must give effect to the solution, agreement or decision (}{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 MAP solution}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ) by making any adjustment (other than in relation to any additional tax, fines and penalties imposed under }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Part 14}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ) that is appropriate as a result of the MAP solution, despite any provision in this Ordinance.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (7)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 If the Commissioner considers it appropriate to do so having regard to a MAP solution, the Commissioner may adjust any additional tax imposed under }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Part 14}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  unless the Board of Review or the court has delivered a decision, opinion, determination or direction in respect of the assessment of the additional tax.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (8)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 The Commissioner may decide the way in which an adjustment under subsection (6) or (7) is to be made, including by way of discharge or repayment of tax, the allowance of credit against tax payable in Hong Kong, or the making of an assessment.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (9)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 In this section\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-480\li1200\sl260{{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 arbitrator}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  (}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f13\u20210??\u35009??\u21729??}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ) means a person who is appointed by mutual agreement between the competent authorities of Hong Kong and the DTA territory concerned to conduct arbitration;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-480\li1200\sl260{{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 competent authority}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  (}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f13\u20027??\u31649??\u30070??\u23616??}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ) has the meaning given by the double taxation arrangements concerned.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i\fs22\qr\sb0\sa80\keepn\li720\sl260{{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qr\qr\li720\cf1 \f0 (Added }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qr\qr\li720\cf1 \f0 27 of 2018 s. 8}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qr\qr\li720\cf1 \f0 )\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\fs22\qc\sb0\sa0{{\nosupersub\nosupersub\qc\qc\cf1 \f0 ___________\par }}
