\pard\plain \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid1779345 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\kerning2\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af14\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\*\latentstyles\lsdstimax267\lsdlockeddef0\lsdsemihiddendef1\lsdunhideuseddef1\lsdqformatdef0\lsdprioritydef99{\lsdlockedexcept \lsdsemihidden0 \lsdunhideused0 \lsdqformat1 \lsdpriority0 \lsdlocked0 Normal;}}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs28\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl320{\pagebb{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs28\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Part 8AA\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs28\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl320{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs28\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Transfer Pricing Rules, Relief and Advance Pricing Arrangement\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i\fs22\qr\sb0\sa80\li0\sl260{{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qr\qr\li0\cf1 \f0 (}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qr\qr\li0\cf1 \f0 Part 8AA}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qr\qr\li0\cf1 \f0  added }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qr\qr\li0\cf1 \f0 27 of 2018 s. 9}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qr\qr\li0\cf1 \f0 )\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa80\li1280\sl220{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1280\cf1 \f0 Note (with no legislative effect) providing an overview of }{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1280\cf1 \f0 Part 8AA}{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1280\cf1 \f0 \u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-480\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl220{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 1.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 Apart from defining relevant terms, Division 1 applies }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 Part 8AA}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0  to determining property tax, salaries tax and profits tax and requires the Part to be read in a way that best secures consistency between its effect and the effect given to Articles 7 and 9 of the Model Tax Convention on Income and on Capital approved by the Organisation for Economic Co-operation and Development. The expression }{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 provision}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0  is broadly equivalent to the expression }{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 condition made or imposed}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0  in Article 9.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-480\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl220{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 2.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 Division 2 incorporates the international transfer pricing rules and has the following effect\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li2160\tqr\tx1920\sl220{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 in relation to a year of assessment beginning on or after 1 April 2018\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li2640\tqr\tx2400\sl220{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li2640\cf1 \f0 (i)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2640\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li2640\cf1 \f0 a person\u8217??s tax liability under this Ordinance is to be determined on the basis that a provision made or imposed between the person and the person\u8217??s associated person is made or imposed on an arm\u8217??s length basis;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li2640\tqr\tx2400\sl220{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li2640\cf1 \f0 (ii)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2640\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li2640\cf1 \f0 in other words, a person who would have a Hong Kong tax advantage if taxed on the basis of a non-arm\u8217??s length provision (}{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li2640\cf1 \f0 advantaged person}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li2640\cf1 \f0 ) will have income adjusted upwards or loss adjusted downwards;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li2160\tqr\tx1920\sl220{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 similarly, in relation to a year of assessment beginning on or after 1 April 2019, the income or loss of a non-Hong Kong resident person attributable to the person\u8217??s permanent establishment in Hong Kong is to be determined as if the permanent establishment were a distinct and separate enterprise.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-480\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl220{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 3.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 The arm\u8217??s length provision is to be determined in accordance with the OECD rules (as defined by }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 section 50AAC(1)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 ). It is possible that application of the OECD rules may not produce a single provision (such as an exact figure as the price) but may produce a range of provisions where each provision constitutes an arm\u8217??s length provision.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-480\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl220{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 4.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 Division 3 provides that, after adjustment to tax assessment is made on the advantaged person to reflect the arm\u8217??s length provision, corresponding relief may be applied for by the disadvantaged person (that is, the person who would suffer a tax disadvantage if taxed on the basis of the non-arm\u8217??s length provision) to avoid double taxation. Similar relief applies in relation to transactions between parts of the same enterprise in different territories.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-480\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl220{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 5.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 Under Division 4, a person and the Commissioner may, by an advance pricing arrangement, agree in advance on a method for resolving issues arising from Division 2.\par }}
