 the provisions of this Ordinance as to notice of assessment, objection, appeal and other proceedings shall apply to such assessment and to the tax charged thereunder.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (Added }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 2 of 1971 s. 39}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 )\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (3)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 No assessment shall be made under subsection (2) if the repayment was in fact made on the basis of, or in accordance with, the practice generally prevailing at the time when the repayment was made.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (Added }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 2 of 1971 s. 39}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 )\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (4)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Section 27 of Schedule 17A}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  (specified alternative bond scheme and its treatment under this Ordinance (other than }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Part 4AA}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 )) provides for modifications to this section.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (Added }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 10 of 2013 s. 12}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 . Amended }