nction as a member of the Board in relation to the appeal in accordance with }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 section 68(2C)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 , }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 69AA(1)(a)(ii)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0  or }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 69A(3)(a)(ii)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0  until the appeal is finally disposed of by the Board. }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (Replaced }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 4 of 2010 s. 9}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 . Amended }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 17 of 2015 s. 3}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 )\par }}
