\pard\plain \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid1779345 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\kerning2\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af14\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\*\latentstyles\lsdstimax267\lsdlockeddef0\lsdsemihiddendef1\lsdunhideuseddef1\lsdqformatdef0\lsdprioritydef99{\lsdlockedexcept \lsdsemihidden0 \lsdunhideused0 \lsdqformat1 \lsdpriority0 \lsdlocked0 Normal;}}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\keepn\fi-720\li720\tx960\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 70.}{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Assessments or amended assessments to be final\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Where no valid objection or appeal has been lodged within the time limited by this Part against an assessment as regards the amount of the assessable income or profits or net assessable value assessed thereby, or where an appeal against an assessment has been withdrawn under }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 section 68(1A)(a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  or dismissed under subsection (2B) of that section, or where the amount of the assessable income or profits or net assessable value has been agreed to under }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 section 64(3)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 , or where the amount of such assessable income or profits or net assessable value has been determined on objection or appeal, the assessment as made or agreed to or determined on objection or appeal, as the case may be, shall be final and conclusive for all purposes of this Ordinance as regards the amount of such assessable income or profits or net assessable value:}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 (Amended }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 49 of 1956 s. 51}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 ; }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 35 of 1965 s. 35}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 ; }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 40 of 1972 s. 9}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 ; }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 7 of 1979 s. 4}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 ; }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 12 of 2004 s. 16}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 )\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Provided that nothing in this Part shall prevent an assessor from making an assessment or additional assessment for any year of assessment which does not involve re-opening any matter which has been determined on objection or appeal for the year.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 (Amended }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 35 of 1965 s. 35}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 )\par }}
