rsub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ) made within 12 months after that date, or within 6 years after the end of the relevant year, whichever is the later, it is established to the satisfaction of an assessor that the tax charged for the relevant year is excessive solely by reason of the commencement of that section, the assessor shall revise the assessment for the relevant year.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (2)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Where an assessor refuses to revise an assessment in accordance with an application under this section, he shall give notice thereof in writing to the person who made such application and such person shall thereupon have the same rights of objection and appeal under this Part as if such notice of refusal were a notice of assessment.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i\fs22\qr\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qr\qr\li720\cf1 \f0 (Added }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qr\qr\li720\cf1 \f0 12 of 2004 s. 17}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qr\qr\li720\cf1 \f0 )\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa0\li720{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f1 _____________________\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa0\li720{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f1 Editorial Note:\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs2\qj\sb0\sa0\fi0\li720\sl20{\par}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs2\qj\sb0\sa0\fi0\li720\sl20{{\pard\intbl\ltrch\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\intbl\fs18\ql\sb0\sa0{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\ql\ql\cf1 \f0 *}}{\cell}\pard\intbl\ltrch\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\intbl\fs18\qj\sb0\sa0{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\cf1 \f1 Commencement date: 25 June 2004.}}{\cell}{
