ect of a future event or any other matter;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (c)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 the matter on which the ruling is sought is subject to an objection or appeal, whether in relation to the applicant or any other person; or\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (d)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 the matter on which the ruling is sought is the subject of a return which has been or is due to be lodged under this Ordinance.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 3.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The Commissioner shall not make a ruling if\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 the Commissioner considers that the arrangement in relation to which the ruling is sought is not seriously contemplated by the applicant;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 the application is frivolous or vexatious;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (c)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 the Commissioner is undertaking an audit on how any provision of this Ordinance applies to the applicant, or to an arrangement similar to the arrangement which is the subject of the application, during any period for which the proposed ruling would apply were the ruling to be made;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (d)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 the Commissioner considers that the applicant has not provided sufficient information in relation to the application; or\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (e)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 the Commissioner considers that it would be unreasonable to make a ruling in view of the resources available to the Commissioner.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 4.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The Commissioner shall, where he has declined to make a ruling under }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 section 2}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  or has not made a ruling by virtue of }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 section 3}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 , notify the applicant in writing of his decision and the reasons therefor.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 5.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Where the Commissioner has made a ruling to a person on the application of any provision of this Ordinance in relation to an arrangement, and\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 the ruling applies in relation to the arrangement during the whole or any part of the period specified in the ruling; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 the person has under }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 section 15}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0  disclosed in the return provided under this Ordinance that he has relied on the ruling in preparing and providing the return,\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 the Commissioner shall apply the provision in relation to the person and the arrangement in respect of the whole of the period or the part of the period, as the case may be, in accordance with the ruling.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 6.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 A ruling shall apply in relation to an arrangement as a ruling on a provision of this Ordinance only if the provision is expressly referred to in the ruling and only for the period specified in the ruling.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 7.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 A ruling shall not apply in relation to an arrangement if\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 the arrangement is materially different from the arrangement identified in the ruling;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 there was a material omission or misrepresentation in, or in connection with, the application seeking the ruling; or\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (c)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 any assumption of the Commissioner in respect of a future event or any other matter that is stated in the ruling is incorrect.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 8.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 An application for a ruling must\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 identify the applicant;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 disclose all relevant facts and documents relating to the arrangement in respect of which the ruling is sought;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (c)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 state the provision of this Ordinance in respect of which the ruling is sought;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (d)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 state the proposition of law (if any) which is relevant to the issues raised in the application;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (e)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 provide such other information as the Commissioner may specify in writing from time to time for the purposes of this section; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (f)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 be accompanied by a draft ruling.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 9.}{\