ed as an individual account.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 6.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 In applying the rules of account aggregation and currency}{\b0\i0\super\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 set out in the due diligence requirements in this Schedule, an account balance that has a negative value is to be treated as having a nil value.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs28\qc\sb240\sa80\li0\sl320{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs28\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Part 3\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs28\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl320{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs28\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Due Diligence Requirements for Pre-existing Individual Accounts\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\keepn\fi-720\li720\tx960\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 1.}{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Application\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 This Part specifies the requirements that apply to pre-existing individual accounts in identifying a reportable account.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\keepn\fi-720\li720\tx960\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 2.}{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Accounts not required to be reviewed, identified, or reported\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 A pre-existing individual account that is a cash value insurance contract or an annuity contract is not required to be reviewed, identified or reported, if the reporting financial institution is effectively prevented by law from selling the contract to residents for tax purposes of a reportable jurisdiction.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\keepn\fi-720\li720\tx960\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 3.}{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Low value accounts\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (1)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 The requirements in this section apply to low value accounts.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (2)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 If a reporting financial institution has in its records a current residence address for the individual account holder based on documentary evidence, the institution may treat the individual account holder as a resident for tax purposes of the jurisdiction in which the address is located for the purpose of determining whether the individual account holder is a reportable person.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (3)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 If a reporting financial institution does not rely on the current residence address for the individual account holder based on documentary evidence as mentioned in subsection (2), the institution must review electronically searchable data maintained by the institution for any of the following indicia and apply the provisions in subsections (4), (5), (6), (7), (8) and (9)\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 identification of the account holder as a resident for tax purposes of a reportable jurisdiction;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 current mailing or residence address (including a post office box) in a reportable jurisdiction;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (c)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 one or more telephone numbers in a reportable jurisdiction outside Hong Kong with no telephone number in Hong Kong;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (d)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 standing instructions (other than with respect to a depository account) to transfer funds to an account maintained in a reportable jurisdiction;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (e)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 currently effective power of attorney or signatory authority granted to a person with an address in a reportable jurisdiction;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (f)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 a hold mail instruction or in-care-of address in a reportable jurisdiction if the institution does not have any other address on file for the account holder.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (4)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 If none of the indicia described in subsection (3) is discovered in the electronic search, then no further action is required until\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 there is a change in circumstances that results in one or more indicia being associated with the account; or\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 the account becomes a high value account.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (5)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 If any of the indicia described in subsection }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (3)(a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 , (b), (c), (d) and (e) is discovered in the electronic search, or if there is a change in circumstances that results in one or more indicia being associated with the account, then the reporting financial institution must treat the account holder as a resident for tax purposes of a reportable jurisdiction for which an indicium is identified, unless it elects to apply subsection (8) or (9), or both, and any of the exceptions in subsections (8) and (9) applies to the account.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (6)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 If a hold mail instruction or in-care-of address is discovered in the electronic search and no other address and none of the other indicia described in subsection }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (3)(a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 , (b), (c), (d) and (e) is identified for the account holder, the reporting financial institution must\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 in the order most appropriate to the circumstances, perform the paper record search described in }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 section 4(4)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0  of this Part; or\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 seek to obtain from the account holder a self-certification or documentary evidence to establish the jurisdiction of residence for the account holder.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (7)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 If\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 the paper record search under subsection }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (6)(a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0  fails to establish an indicium; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 the attempt to obtain the self-certification or documentary evidence under subsection }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (6)(b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0  is not successful,\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\li1200\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 the reporting financial institution must report the account as an undocumented account.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (8)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Despite any finding of an indicium described in subsection }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (3)(b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 , (c) or (d) for a financial account, a reporting financial institution is not required to treat its account holder as a resident for tax purposes of a reportable jurisdiction if it obtains, or has previously reviewed and maintains a record of, both of the following\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 a self-certification from the account holder showing that his or her jurisdiction of residence does not include that reportable jurisdiction;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 documentary evidence establishing the jurisdiction of residence for the account holder other than that reportable jurisdiction.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (9)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Despite any finding of an indicium described in subsection }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (3)(e)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  for a financial account, a reporting financial institution is not required to treat its account holder as a resident for tax purposes of a reportable jurisdiction if it obtains, or has previously reviewed and maintains a record of, any of the following\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 a self-certification from the account holder showing that his or her jurisdiction of residence does not include that reportable jurisdiction;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 documentary evidence establishing the jurisdiction of residence for the account holder other than that reportable jurisdiction.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\keepn\fi-720\li720\tx960\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 4.}{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Enhanced review procedures for high value accounts\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (1)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 This section provides for enhanced review procedures and applies to high value accounts.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (2)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 With respect to a high value account, the reporting financial institution must review electronically searchable data maintained by the institution for any of the indicia described in }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 section 3(3)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  of this Part.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (3)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 If the reporting financial institution\u8217??s electronically searchable databases (}{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 e-databases}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ) include fields for, and capture all of the information described in, subsection (5), then a further paper record search is not required.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (4)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 However, if the e-databases do not capture all of the information described in subsection (5), then with respect to a high value account, the reporting financial institution must also review the current customer master file and, to the extent not contained in the current customer master file, the following documents associated with the account and obtained by the institution within the last 5 years for any of the indicia described in }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 section 3(3)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  of this Part\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 the most recent documentary evidence collected with respect to the account;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 the most recent account opening contract or documentation;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (c)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 the most recent documentation collected by the reporting financial institution pursuant to AML/KYC procedures or for other regulatory purposes;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (d)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 any standing instructions (other than with respect to a depository account) to transfer funds currently in effect;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (e)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 any power of attorney or signatory authority currently in effect.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (5)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 A reporting financial institution is not required to perform the paper record search described in subsection (4) if its electronically searchable information includes the following information\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 the account holder\u8217??s residence status;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 the account holder\u8217??s mailing and residence address currently on file with the reporting financial institution;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (c)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 the account holder\u8217??s telephone number currently on file, if any, with the reporting financial institution;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (d)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 for financial accounts other than depository accounts, whether there are standing instructions to transfer funds in the account to another account (including an account at another branch of the reporting financial institution or another financial institution);\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (e)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 whether there is a current hold mail instruction or in-care-of address for the account holder;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (f)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 whether there is any power of attorney or signatory authority for the account.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (6)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Apart from conducting the electronic and paper record searches described in subsections (2) and (4), the reporting financial institution must treat as a reportable account any high value account assigned to a relationship manager of the institution (including any financial accounts aggregated with that high value account) if the relationship manager has actual knowledge that the account holder is a reportable person.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (7)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 After an enhanced review of a high value account under subsection (2) or (4) is performed\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 if\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li2160\tqr\tx1920\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 (i)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 none of the indicia described in }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 section 3(3)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0  of this Part is discovered; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li2160\tqr\tx1920\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 (ii)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 the account is not identified as held by a resident for tax purposes of a reportable jurisdiction in subsection (6),\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\li1680\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 then further action is not required until there is a change in circumstances that results in one or more indicia being associated with the account;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 if\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li2160\tqr\tx1920\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 (i)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 any of the indicia described in }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 section 3(3)(a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 , (b), (c), (d) and (e) of this Part is discovered; or\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li2160\tqr\tx1920\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 (ii)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 there is a subsequent change in circumstances that results in one or more indicia being associated with the account,\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\li1680\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 then the reporting financial institution must treat the account holder as a resident for tax purposes of each reportable jurisdiction for which an indicium is identified unless it elects to apply subsection (8) or (9), or both, of }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 section 3}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0  of this Part and any of the exceptions in subsections (8) and (9) of that section applies to the account; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (c)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 if\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li2160\tqr\tx1920\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 (i)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 a hold mail instruction or in-care-of address is discovered; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li2160\tqr\tx1920\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 (ii)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 no other address and none of the other indicia described in }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 section 3(3)(a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 , (b), (c), (d) and (e) of this Part is identified for the account holder,\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\li1680\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 then the reporting financial institution must obtain from the account holder a self-certification or documentary evidence to establish the jurisdiction of residence for the account holder and (if it cannot obtain such self-certification or documentary evidence) must report the account as an undocumented account.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (8)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 If a pre-existing individual account is not a high value account as at 31 December of the second year before the reporting year, but becomes a high value account as at the last day of a subsequent calendar year\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 the reporting financial institution must complete the enhanced review procedures under this section with respect to the account within the calendar year following the year in which the account becomes a high value account; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (if based on the review under paragraph (a), the account is identified as a reportable account) the reporting financial institution must report the required information about the account with respect to the year in which it is identified as a reportable account and subsequent years on an annual basis, unless the account holder ceases to be a reportable person.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (9)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Once a reporting financial institution applies the enhanced review procedures under this section to a high value account, the reporting financial institution is not required to reapply the procedures, other than the procedure in subsection (6), to the same high value account in any subsequent year unless the account is undocumented where the reporting financial institution must reapply them annually until the account ceases to be undocumented.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (10)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 If there is a change of circumstances with respect to a high value account that results in one or more indicia described in subsection (3) of }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 section 3}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  of this Part being associated with the account, then the reporting financial institution must treat the account as a reportable account with respect to each reportable jurisdiction for which an indicium is identified unless it elects to apply subsection (8) or (9), or both, of }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 section 3}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  of this Part and any of the exceptions in subsections (8) and (9) of that section applies to the account.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (11)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 A reporting financial institution must implement procedures to ensure that a relationship manager of the institution identifies any change in circumstances of an account.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (12)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Without limiting subsection (11), if a relationship manager is notified that the account holder has a new mailing address in a reportable jurisdiction, the reporting financial institution\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 must treat the new address as a change in circumstances; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 if the institution elects to apply subsection (8) or (9), or both, of }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 section 3}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0  of this Part, must obtain the appropriate documentation from the account holder.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\keepn\fi-720\li720\tx960\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 5.}{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Review of pre-existing individual accounts\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (1)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Review of a pre-existing individual account that is a high value account must be completed on or before 31 December of the year before the reporting year for the account.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (2)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Review of a pre-existing individual account that is a low value account must be completed on or before 31 December of the reporting year for the account.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs28\qc\sb240\sa80\li0\sl320{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs28\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Part 4\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs28\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl320{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs28\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Due Diligence Requirements for New Individual Accounts\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\keepn\fi-720\li720\tx960\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 1.}{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Application\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 This Part specifies the requirements that apply to new individual accounts in identifying a reportable account.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\keepn\fi-720\li720\tx960\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 2.}{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Requirements\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (1)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 On the opening of a new individual account, a reporting financial institution must\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 obtain a self-certification, which may be part of the account opening documentation, that allows the institution to determine the jurisdiction of residence for the account holder; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 confirm the reasonableness of the self-certification based on the information obtained by the institution in connection with the opening of the account, including any documentation collected pursuant to AML/KYC procedures.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (2)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 If the self-certification establishes that the account holder is a resident for tax purposes of a reportable jurisdiction\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 the reporting financial institution must treat the account as a reportable account; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 the self-certification must also include the account holder\u8217??s date of birth and (subject to }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 section 50G(1)(b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 ) the account holder\u8217??s TIN with respect to the reportable jurisdiction.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (3)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 If there is a change of circumstances with respect to a new individual account that causes the reporting financial institution to know, or have reason to know, that the original self-certification is incorrect or unreliable, the institution\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 cannot rely on the original self-certification; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 must obtain a valid self-certification that establishes the jurisdiction of residence for the account holder.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs28\qc\sb240\sa80\li0\sl320{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs28\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Part 5\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs28\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl320{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs28\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Due Diligence Requirements for Pre-existing Entity Accounts\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs26\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl300{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs26\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Division 1}{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs26\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 \u8212??}{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs26\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 General\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\keepn\fi-720\li720\tx960\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 1.}{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Application\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 This Part specifies the requirements that apply to pre-existing entity accounts in identifying a reportable account.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs26\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl300{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs26\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Division 2}{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs26\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 \u8212??}{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs26\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Entity Accounts subject to Review\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\keepn\fi-720\li720\tx960\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 2.}{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Entity accounts not required to be reviewed, identified or reported\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (1)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 A pre-existing entity account with an aggregate account balance or value that does not exceed $1,950,000 as at 31 December of the second year before the reporting year, is not required to be reviewed, identified, or reported as a reportable account until the aggregate account balance or value exceeds $1,950,000 as at the last day of any subsequent calendar year.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (2)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Subsection (1) does not apply if the reporting financial institution elects otherwise, whether with respect to all pre-existing entity accounts or, separately, with respect to any clearly identified group of such accounts.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\keepn\fi-720\li720\tx960\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 3.}{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Entity accounts subject to review\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 A pre-existing entity account must be reviewed in accordance with the review procedures under }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 section 4}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  of this Part if\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 the account has an aggregate account balance or value that exceeds $1,950,000 as at 31 December of the second year before the reporting year; or\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 the account does not exceed $1,950,000 as at 31 December of the second year before the reporting year but the aggregate account balance or value of the account exceeds $1,950,000 as at the last day of any subsequent calendar year.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs26\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl300{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs26\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Division 3}{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs26\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 \u8212??}{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs26\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Review Procedures\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\keepn\fi-720\li720\tx960\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 4.}{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Review procedures for identifying entity accounts with respect to which reporting may be required\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 For a pre-existing entity account described in }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 section 3}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  of this Part, a reporting financial institution must apply the review procedures under this Division.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\keepn\fi-720\li720\tx960\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 5.}{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Determining residence of entity that holds pre-existing entity account\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (1)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 The reporting financial institution must review information maintained for regulatory or customer relationship purposes (including information collected and maintained pursuant to AML/KYC procedures) to determine the account holder\u8217??s residence.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (2)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 For the purpose of subsection (1), information indicating the account holder\u8217??s residence includes a place of incorporation or organization, or an address in a reportable jurisdiction.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (3)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 If the information indicates that the account holder is a reportable person, the reporting financial institution must treat the account as a reportable account unless it obtains a self-certification from the account holder, or reasonably determines, based on information in its possession or that is publicly available, that the account holder is not a reportable person.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\keepn\fi-720\li720\tx960\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 6.}{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Determining residence of controlling persons of passive NFE\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (1)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 With respect to an account holder of a pre-existing entity account (including an entity that is a reportable person), the reporting financial institution must identify whether the account holder is a passive NFE with one or more controlling persons, and determine the residence of the controlling persons.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (2)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 If any of the controlling persons of a passive NFE is a reportable person, then the account is to be treated as a reportable account.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (3)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 In making the determinations, the reporting financial institution must follow the guidance in }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 sections 7}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 , }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 8}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  and }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 9}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  of this Part in the order most appropriate under the circumstances.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\keepn\fi-720\li720\tx960\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 7.}{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Determining whether account holder is passive NFE\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 For the purpose of determining whether the account holder is a passive NFE, the reporting financial institution must obtain and rely on a self-certification from the account holder to establish the account holder\u8217??s status, unless it has information in its possession or that is publicly available, based on which it can reasonably determine that the account holder is\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 an active NFE; or\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 a financial institution other than an investment entity within the meaning of paragraph (e) of the definition of }{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 investment entity}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0  in }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 section 50A(1)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0  that is not a participating jurisdiction financial institution.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\keepn\fi-720\li720\tx960\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 8.}{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Determining controlling persons of an account holder\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 For the purpose of determining the controlling persons of an account holder, a reporting financial institution may rely on information collected and maintained pursuant to AML/KYC procedures.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\keepn\fi-720\li720\tx960\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 9.}{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Determining residence of controlling person of passive NFE\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (1)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 For the purpose of determining the residence of a controlling person of a passive NFE, a reporting financial institution may rely on\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 information collected and maintained pursuant to AML/KYC procedures in the case of a pre-existing entity account held by one or more passive NFEs with an aggregate account balance or value that does not exceed}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf116 \f0  }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 $7,800,000; or\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 a self-certification from the account holder or the controlling person of the jurisdiction for which the controlling person is a resident for tax purposes.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (2)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 For the purpose of subsection }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (1)(b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 , if a self-certification is not provided, the reporting financial institution must establish the residence by applying the review procedures under }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 section 4 of Part 3}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  of this Schedule.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs26\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl300{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs26\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Division 4}{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs26\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 \u8212??}{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs26\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Timing of Review, etc.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\keepn\fi-720\li720\tx960\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 10.}{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Timing of review\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (1)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Review of a pre-existing entity account with an aggregate account balance or value that exceeds $1,950,000 as at 31 December of the second year before a reporting year must be completed on or before 31 December of the reporting year for the account.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (2)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Review of a pre-existing entity account with an aggregate account balance or value that does not exceed $1,950,000 as at 31 December of the second year before the reporting year, but exceeds $1,950,000 as at the last day of a subsequent calendar year, must be completed within the calendar year following the year in which the aggregate account balance or value exceeds $1,950,000.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\keepn\fi-720\li720\tx960\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 11.}{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Additional procedures applicable to pre-existing entity accounts\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 If there is a change of circumstances with respect to a pre-existing entity account that causes the reporting financial institution to know, or have reason to know, that the self-certification or other documentation associated with an account is incorrect or unreliable, the institution must re-determine the status of the account in accordance with the review procedures under }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Division 3}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  of this Part.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs28\qc\sb240\sa80\li0\sl320{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs28\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Part 6\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs28\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl320{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs28\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Due Diligence Requirements for New Entity Accounts\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\keepn\fi-720\li720\tx960\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 1.}{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Application\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 This Part specifies the requirements that apply to new entity accounts in identifying a reportable account.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\keepn\fi-720\li720\tx960\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 2.}{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Determining residence of entity\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (1)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 A reporting financial institution must\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 obtain a self-certification from an entity that opens an account, which may be part of the account opening documentation, that allows the institution to determine the jurisdiction of residence for the account holder; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 confirm the reasonableness of the self-certification based on the information obtained by the institution in connection with the opening of the account, including any documentation collected and maintained pursuant to AML/KYC procedures.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (2)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 If the entity certifies that it is not a resident for tax purposes of any jurisdiction, the reporting financial institution may rely on the address of the principal office of the entity to determine the residence of the account holder.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (3)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 If the self-certification indicates that the account holder is a resident for tax purposes of a reportable jurisdiction, the reporting financial institution must treat the account as a reportable account unless it reasonably determines, based on information in its possession or that is publicly available, that the account holder is not a reportable person with respect to the reportable jurisdiction.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\keepn\fi-720\li720\tx960\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 3.}{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Determining residence of controlling persons of passive NFE\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (1)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 With respect to an account holder of a new entity account (including an entity that is a reportable person), the reporting financial institution must identify whether the account holder is a passive NFE with one or more controlling persons, and determine the residence of the reportable persons.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (2)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 If any of the controlling persons of a passive NFE is a reportable person, then the account is to be treated as a reportable account.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (3)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 In making the determination, the reporting financial institution must follow the guidance in }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 sections 4}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 , }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 5}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  and }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 6}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  of this Part in the order most appropriate under the circumstances.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\keepn\fi-720\li720\tx960\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 4.}{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Determining whether account holder is passive NFE\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 For the purpose of determining whether the account holder is a passive NFE, the reporting financial institution must obtain and rely on a self-certification from the account holder to establish the account holder\u8217??s status, unless it has information in its possession or that is publicly available, based on which it can reasonably determine that the account holder is\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 an active NFE; or\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 a financial institution other than an investment entity within the meaning of paragraph (e) of the definition of }{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 investment entity}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0  in }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 section 50A(1)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0  that is not a participating jurisdiction financial institution.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\keepn\fi-720\li720\tx960\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 5.}{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Determining controlling persons of account holder\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 For the purpose of determining the controlling persons of an account holder, a reporting financial institution may rely on information collected and maintained pursuant to AML/KYC procedures if those procedures are consistent with Recommendations 10 and 25 of the FATF Recommendations (as defined by}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  section 50A(1)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 ). \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i\fs22\qr\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qr\qr\li720\cf1 \f0 (Amended }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qr\qr\li720\cf1 \f0 L.N. 43 of 2020}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qr\qr\li720\cf1 \f0 )\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\keepn\fi-720\li720\tx960\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 6.}{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Determining residence of controlling person of passive NFE\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 For the purpose of determining the residence of a controlling person of a passive NFE, a reporting financial institution may rely only on a self-certification from the account holder or the controlling person. \par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i\fs22\qr\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qr\qr\li720\cf1 \f0 (Amended }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qr\qr\li720\cf1 \f0 5 of 2018 s. 11}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qr\qr\li720\cf1 \f0 )\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs28\qc\sb240\sa80\li0\sl320{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs28\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Part 7\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs28\qc\sb240\sa80\keepn\li0\sl320{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs28\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 Special Due Diligence Requirements\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\keepn\fi-720\li720\tx960\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 1.}{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Application\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 This Part specifies the additional requirements that apply in applying the due diligence requirements in }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Parts 2}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 , }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 3}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 , }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 4}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 , }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 5}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  and }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 6}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  of this Schedule.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\keepn\fi-720\li720\tx960\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 2.}{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Reliance on self-certifications and documentary evidence\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 A reporting financial institution may not rely on self-certification or documentary evidence if it knows or has reason to know that the self-certification or documentary evidence is incorrect or unreliable.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\keepn\fi-720\li720\tx960\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 3.}{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Alternative procedures for financial accounts held by individual beneficiaries of cash value insurance contract or annuity contract\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (1)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 A reporting financial institution may presume that an individual beneficiary (other than the owner) of a cash value insurance contract or an annuity contract receiving a death benefit is not a reportable person and may treat the financial account as other than a reportable account unless the institution has actual knowledge, or reason to know, that the beneficiary is a reportable person.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (2)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 A reporting financial institution has reason to know that a beneficiary of a cash value insurance contract or an annuity contract is a reportable person if the information collected by the institution and associated with the beneficiary contains indicia of residence in a reportable jurisdiction as described in }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 section 3 of Part 3}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  of this Schedule.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (3)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 If a reporting financial institution has actual knowledge, or reason to know, that the beneficiary is a reportable person, the institution must apply the requirements in }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 section 3 of Part 3}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  of this Schedule.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\keepn\fi-720\li720\tx960\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 4.}{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Alternative procedures for group cash value insurance contract or group annuity contract\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (1)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 A reporting financial institution may treat a financial account that is a member\u8217??s interest in a group cash value insurance contract or group annuity contract as a financial account that is not a reportable account until the date on which an amount is payable to the employee, certificate holder or beneficiary, if the financial account that is a member\u8217??s interest in a group cash value insurance contract or group annuity contract meets all of the following conditions\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 the group cash value insurance contract or group annuity contract is issued to the employer and covers 25 or more employees or certificate holders;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 the employees or certificate holders are entitled to receive any contract value related to their interests and to name beneficiaries for the benefit payable on the death of the employee or certificate holder;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (c)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 the aggregate amount payable to any employee or certificate holder or beneficiary does not exceed $7,800,000.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (2)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 In subsection (1)\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-480\li1200\sl260{{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 group annuity contract}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  (}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f13\u22296??\u39636??\u24180??\u37329??\u21512??\u32004??}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ) means an annuity contract under which the obligees are individuals who are affiliated through an employer, trade association, labour union, or other association or group;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-480\li1200\sl260{{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 group cash value insurance contract}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  (}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f13\u22296??\u39636??\u29694??\u37329??\u20540??\u20445??\u38570??\u21512??\u32004??}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ) means a cash value insurance contract that\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 provides coverage on individuals who are affiliated through an employer, trade association, labour union, or other association or group; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 charges a premium for each member of the group (or member of a class within the group) that is determined without regard to the individual health characteristics other than age, gender, and smoking habits of the member (or class of members) of the group.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\keepn\fi-720\li720\tx960\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 5.}{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Rules of account aggregation and currency\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (1)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 For the purpose of determining the aggregate balance or value of financial accounts held by an individual, a reporting financial institution must aggregate all financial accounts maintained by the institution, or by a related entity, but only to the extent that the institution\u8217??s computerized systems\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 link the financial accounts by reference to a data element such as client number or TIN; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 allow account balances or values to be aggregated.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (2)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Each holder of a jointly held financial account must be attributed the entire balance or value of the jointly held financial account for the purpose of applying the aggregation requirements described in subsection (1).\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (3)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 For the purpose of determining the aggregate balance or value of financial accounts held by an entity, a reporting financial institution must take into account all financial accounts that are maintained by the institution, or by a related entity, but only to the extent that the institution\u8217??s computerized systems\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 link the financial accounts by reference to a data element such as client number or TIN; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 allow account balances or values to be aggregated.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (4)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Each holder of a jointly held financial account must be attributed the entire balance or value of the jointly held financial account for the purpose of applying the aggregation requirements described in subsection (3).\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (5)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 For the purpose of determining the aggregate balance or value of financial accounts held by a person and whether a financial account is a high value account, if a relationship manager of a reporting financial institution knows, or has reason to know, any financial accounts are directly or indirectly owned, controlled, or established (other than in a fiduciary capacity) by the same person, the institution must aggregate all those accounts.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\keepn\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (6)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 References to a dollar amount in this }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Schedule }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 are to be read as including an equivalent amount in a foreign currency.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\fs22\qc\sb0\sa0{{\nosupersub\nosupersub\qc\qc\cf1 \f0 ___________\par }}
