rsub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 a description of the management structure of the subject entity, an organization chart of the subject entity, and a description of the individuals to whom the subject entity\u8217??s management reports and the territory or territories in which the individuals maintain their principal offices;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li2160\tqr\tx1920\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 (ii)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 a detailed description of the business and business strategy pursued by the subject entity including an indication whether the subject entity has been involved in or affected by business restructurings or intangibles transfers in the subject accounting period of the subject entity or the subject entity\u8217??s accounting period immediately before it and an explanation of those aspects of such transactions affecting the subject entity; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li2160\tqr\tx1920\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 (iii)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 a list of key competitors;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 in relation to controlled transactions, the following information for each material category of controlled transactions\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li2160\tqr\tx1920\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 (i)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li2160\c