\clbrdrt\brdrtbl \clbrdrl\brdrtbl \clbrdrb\brdrtbl \clbrdrr\brdrtbl\clpadl0\clpadfl3\clpadt0\clpadft3\clpadb0\clpadfb3\clpadr0\clpadfr3\clshdrawnil\cltxlrtb\clftsWidth2\clwWidth1875\clNoWrap\cellx9385\row}}}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 where, for each fiscal year:\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 the number of employees in Hong Kong is the total number of employees of all the constituent entities of the MNE group located in Hong Kong;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 the number of employees in all UTPR jurisdictions is the total number of employees of all the constituent entities of the MNE group located in a jurisdiction that has a qualified UTPR in force for the fiscal year;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (c)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 the total value of tangible assets in Hong Kong is the sum of the net book values of tangible assets of all the constituent entities of the MNE group located in Hong Kong;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (d)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 the total value of tangible assets in all UTPR jurisdictions is the sum of the net book values of tangible assets of all the constituent entities of the MNE group located in a jurisdiction that has a qualified UTPR in force for the fiscal year.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??2.6.2.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 For purposes of Article 2.6.1,\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 the number of employees employed and the net book value of tangible assets held by an investment-related entity shall be excluded from the elements of the formula for allocating the total UTPR top-up tax amount;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 the number of employees employed and the net book value of tangible assets held by a flow-through entity that are not allocated to permanent establishments shall be allocated to the constituent entities (if any) that are located in the jurisdiction where the flow-through entity was created. The number of employees employed and the net book value of tangible assets held by a flow-through entity that are not allocated either to permanent establishments or under this provision shall be excluded from the formula for allocating the total UTPR top-up tax amount.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??2.6.3.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Notwithstanding Article 2.6.1, the UTPR percentage of a UTPR jurisdiction for an MNE group is deemed to be zero for a fiscal year as long as the top-up tax amount allocated to the UTPR jurisdiction in a prior fiscal year has not resulted in the constituent entities of this MNE group located in the UTPR jurisdiction having an additional cash tax expense equal, in total, to the UTPR top-up tax amount for that prior fiscal year allocated to the UTPR jurisdiction. The number of employees and the tangible assets of the constituent entities of this MNE group located in a jurisdiction with a UTPR percentage of zero for a fiscal year shall be excluded from the formula provided under Article 2.6.1 for allocating the total UTPR top-up tax amount for that fiscal year.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??2.6.4.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Article 2.6.3 does not apply for a fiscal year if all jurisdictions with a qualified UTPR in force for the fiscal year have a UTPR percentage of zero for the MNE group for that fiscal year.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Note\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Part 2}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  of this }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Schedule }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 provides for allocation of top-up tax for the UTPR among constituent entities of an MNE group located in Hong Kong.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs28\ql\sb240\sa80\keepn\li240\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs28\ql\ql\li240\cf1 \f0 Chapter 3 Computation of GloBE Income or Loss\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\ql\sb240\sa80\keepn\li240\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li240\cf1 \f0 Article 3.1. Financial accounts\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??3.1.1.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The GloBE income or loss of each constituent entity is the financial accounting net income or loss determined for the constituent entity for the fiscal year adjusted for the items described in Article 3.2 to Article 3.5.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??3.1.2.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Financial accounting net income or loss is the net income or loss determined for a constituent entity (before any consolidation adjustments eliminating intra-group transactions) in preparing consolidated financial statements of the ultimate parent entity.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Note\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa0\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 In relation to Article 3.1.2, see\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 the specified OECD GloBE rules guidance in }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 paragraphs 3}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0  and }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub