\clbrdrt\brdrtbl \clbrdrl\brdrtbl \clbrdrb\brdrtbl \clbrdrr\brdrtbl\clpadl0\clpadfl3\clpadt40\clpadft3\clpadb0\clpadfb3\clpadr40\clpadfr3\clshdrawnil\cltxlrtb\clftsWidth2\clwWidth4509\clNoWrap\cellx9385\row}}}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 For the purposes of the above formula, a specified constituent entity is constituent entity that has net asset gain in the election year and was located in the jurisdiction in the relevant year. If there is no specified constituent entity for a relevant year the adjusted asset gain allocated to that year will be allocated equally to each constituent entity in the jurisdiction in that year.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??3.2.7.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The computation of a low-tax entity\u8217??s GloBE income or loss shall exclude any expense attributable to an intragroup financing arrangement that can reasonably be anticipated, over the expected duration of the arrangement to:\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 increase the amount of expenses taken into account in calculating the GloBE income or loss of the low-tax entity;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 without resulting in a commensurate increase in the taxable income of the high-tax counterparty.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??3.2.8.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 An ultimate parent entity may elect to apply its consolidated accounting treatment to eliminate income, expense, gains, and losses from transactions between constituent entities that are located, and included in a tax consolidation group, in the same jurisdiction for purposes of computing each such constituent entity\u8217??s net GloBE income or loss. The election under this Article is a five-year election. Upon making or revoking such election, appropriate adjustments shall be made for GloBE purposes such that there shall not be duplications or omissions of items of GloBE income or loss as a result of having made or revoked the election.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??3.2.9.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 An insurance company shall exclude from the computation of GloBE income or loss amounts charged to policyholders for taxes paid by the insurance company in respect of returns to the policy holders. An insurance company shall include in the computation of GloBE income or loss any returns to policyholders that are not reflected in financial accounting net income or loss to the extent the corresponding increase or decrease in liability to the policyholders is reflected in its financial accounting net income or loss.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 3.2.10.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Amounts recognised as a decrease to the equity of a constituent entity attributable to distributions paid or payable in respect of additional tier one capital or restricted tier one capital issued by the constituent entity shall be treated as an expense in the computation of its GloBE income or loss. Amounts recognised as an increase to the equity of a constituent entity attributable to distributions received or receivable in respect of additional tier one capital or restricted tier one capital held by the constituent entity shall be included in the computation of its GloBE income or loss.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 3.2.11.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 A constituent entity\u8217??s financial accounting net income or loss must be adjusted as necessary to reflect the requirements of the relevant provisions of Chapters 6 and 7.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\ql\sb240\sa80\keepn\li240\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li240\cf1 \f0 Article 3.3. International shipping income exclusion\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??3.3.1.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 For an MNE group that has international shipping income, each constituent entity\u8217??s international shipping income and qualified ancillary international shipping income shall be excluded from the computation of its GloBE income or loss under Article 3.2 for the jurisdiction in which it is located. Where the computation of a constituent entity\u8217??s international shipping income or qualified ancillary international shipping income results in a loss, the loss shall be excluded from the computation of its GloBE income or loss.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??3.3.2.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 International shipping income means the net income obtained by a constituent entity from:\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 the transportation of passengers or cargo by ships that it operates in international traffic, whether the ship is owned, leased or otherwise at the disposal of the constituent entity;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 the transportation of passengers or cargo by ships operated in international traffic under slot-chartering arrangements;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (c)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 leasing a ship, to be used for the transportation of passengers or cargo in international traffic, on charter fully equipped, crewed and supplied;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (d)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 leasing a ship on a bare boat charter basis, for the use of transportation of passengers or cargo in international traffic, to another constituent entity;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (e)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 the participation in a pool, a joint business or an international operating agency for the transportation of passengers or cargo by ships in international traffic; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (f)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 the sale of a ship used for the transportation of passengers or cargo in international traffic provided that the ship has been held for use by the constituent entity for a minimum of one year.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 International shipping income shall not include net income obtained from the transportation of passengers or cargo by ships via inland waterways within the same jurisdiction.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??3.3.3.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Qualified ancillary international shipping income means net income obtained by a constituent entity from the following activities that are performed primarily in connection with the transportation of passengers or cargo by ships in international traffic:\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 leasing a ship on a bare boat charter basis to another shipping enterprise that is not a constituent entity, provided that the charter does not exceed three years;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 sale of tickets issued by other shipping enterprises for the domestic leg of an international voyage;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (c)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 leasing and short-term storage of containers or detention charges for the late return of containers;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (d)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 provision of services to other shipping enterprises by engineers, maintenance staff, cargo handlers, catering staff, and customer services personnel; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (e)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 investment income where the investment that generates the income is made as an integral part of the carrying on the business of operating the ships in international traffic.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??3.3.4.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The aggregated qualified ancillary international shipping income of all constituent entities located in a jurisdiction shall not exceed 50% of those constituent entities\u8217?? international shipping income.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??3.3.5.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The costs incurred by a constituent entity that are directly attributable to its international shipping activities listed in Article 3.3.2 and the costs directly attributable to its qualified ancillary activities listed in Article 3.3.3 shall be deducted from the constituent entity\u8217??s revenues from such activities to compute its international shipping income and qualified ancillary international shipping income. Other costs incurred by a constituent entity that are indirectly attributable to a constituent entity\u8217??s international shipping activities and qualified ancillary activities shall be allocated on the basis of the constituent entity\u8217??s revenues from such activities in proportion to its total revenues. All direct and indirect costs attributed to a constituent entity\u8217??s international shipping income and qualified ancillary international shipping income shall be excluded from the computation of its GloBE income or loss.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??3.3.6.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 In order for a constituent entity\u8217??s international shipping income and qualified ancillary international shipping income to qualify for the exclusion from its GloBE income or loss under this Article, the constituent entity must demonstrate that the strategic or commercial management of all ships concerned is effectively carried on from within the jurisdiction where the constituent entity is located.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\ql\sb240\sa80\keepn\li240\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li240\cf1 \f0 Article 3.4. Allocation of income or loss between a main entity and a permanent establishment\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??3.4.1.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The financial accounting net income or loss of a constituent entity that is a permanent establishment in accordance with paragraphs (a), (b) and (c) of the definition in Article 10.1 is the net income or loss reflected in the separate financial accounts of the permanent establishment. If the permanent establishment does not have separate financial accounts, then the financial accounting net income or loss is the amount that would have been reflected in its separate financial accounts if prepared on a standalone basis and in accordance with the accounting standard used in the preparation of the consolidated financial accounts of the ultimate parent entity.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??3.4.2.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The financial accounting net income or loss of a permanent establishment referred to in Article 3.4.1 shall be adjusted, if necessary:\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 in the case of a permanent establishment as defined by paragraphs (a) and (b) of the definition in Article 10.1, to reflect only the amounts and items of income and expense that are attributable to the permanent establishment in accordance with the applicable tax treaty or domestic law of the jurisdiction where it is located regardless of the amount of income subject to tax and the amount of deductible expenses in that jurisdiction;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 in the case of a permanent establishment as defined by paragraph (c) of the definition in Article 10.1, to reflect only the amounts and items of income and expense that would have been attributed to it in accordance with Article 7 of the OECD Model Tax Convention.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??3.4.3.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 In case of a constituent entity that is a permanent establishment in accordance with paragraph (d) of the definition in Article 10.1, its income used for computing financial accounting net income or loss is the income being exempted in the jurisdiction where the main entity is located and attributable to the operations conducted outside that jurisdiction. The expenses used for computing financial accounting net income or loss are those that are not deducted for taxable purposes in the jurisdiction where the main entity is located and that are attributable to such operations.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??3.4.4.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The financial accounting net income or loss of a permanent establishment is not taken into account in determining the GloBE income or loss of the main entity, except as provided in Article 3.4.5.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??3.4.5.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 A GloBE loss of a permanent establishment shall be treated as an expense of the main entity (and not of the permanent establishment) for purposes of computing its GloBE income or loss to the extent that the loss of the permanent establishment is treated as an expense in the computation of the domestic taxable income of such main entity and is not set off against an item of income that is subject to tax under the laws of both the jurisdiction of the main entity and the jurisdiction of the permanent establishment. GloBE income subsequently arising in the permanent establishment shall be treated as GloBE income of the main entity (and not the permanent establishment) up to the amount of the GloBE loss that previously was treated as an expense for purposes of computing the GloBE income or loss of the main entity.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\ql\sb240\sa80\keepn\li240\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li240\cf1 \f0 Article 3.5. Allocation of income or loss from a flow-through entity\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??3.5.1.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The financial accounting net income or loss of a constituent entity that is a flow-through entity is allocated as follows:\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 in the case of a permanent establishment through which the business of the entity is wholly or partly carried out, the financial accounting net income or loss of the entity is allocated to that permanent establishment in accordance with Article 3.4;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 in the case of a tax transparent entity that is not the ultimate parent entity, any financial accounting net income or loss remaining after application of paragraph (a) is allocated to its constituent entity-owners in accordance with their ownership interests; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (c)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 in the case of a tax transparent entity that is the ultimate parent entity or a reverse hybrid entity, any financial accounting net income or loss remaining after application of paragraph (a) is allocated to it.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??3.5.2.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The rules of Article 3.5.1 shall be applied separately with respect to each ownership interest in the flow-through entity.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??3.5.3.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Prior to the application of Article 3.5.1, the financial accounting net income or loss of a flow-through entity shall be reduced by the amount allocable to its owners that are not group entities and that hold their ownership interest in the flow-through entity directly or through a tax transparent structure.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Note\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 In relation to Article 3.5.3, see the specified OECD GloBE rules guidance in }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 paragraph 37}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  of Chapter 2 of the 2023 Commentary.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??3.5.4.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Article 3.5.3 does not apply to:\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 an ultimate parent entity that is a flow-through entity; or\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 any flow-through entity owned by such an ultimate parent entity (directly or through a tax transparent structure).\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The treatment of these entities is addressed in Article 7.1.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??3.5.5.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The financial accounting net income or loss of a flow-through entity is reduced by the amount that is allocated to another constituent entity.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs28\ql\sb240\sa80\keepn\li240\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs28\ql\ql\li240\cf1 \f0 Chapter 4 Computation of Adjusted Covered Taxes\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\ql\sb240\sa80\keepn\li240\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li240\cf1 \f0 Article 4.1. Adjusted covered taxes\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??4.1.1.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The adjusted covered taxes of a constituent entity for the fiscal year shall be equal to the current tax expense accrued in its financial accounting net income or loss with respect to covered taxes for the fiscal year adjusted by:\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 the net amount of its additions to covered taxes for the fiscal year (as determined under Article 4.1.2) and reductions to covered taxes for the fiscal year (as determined under Article 4.1.3);\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 the total deferred tax adjustment amount (as determined under Article 4.4); and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (c)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 any increase or decrease in covered taxes recorded in equity or other comprehensive income relating to amounts included in the computation of GloBE income or loss that will be subject to tax under local tax rules.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??4.1.2.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The additions to covered taxes of a constituent entity for the fiscal year is the sum of:\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 any amount of covered taxes accrued as an expense in the profit before taxation in the financial accounts;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 any amount of GloBE loss deferred tax asset used under Article 4.5.3;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (c)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 any amount of covered taxes that is paid in the fiscal year and that relates to an uncertain tax position where that amount has been treated for a previous fiscal year as a reduction to covered taxes under Article 4.1.3(d); and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (d)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 any amount of credit or refund in respect of a qualified refundable tax credit or marketable transferable tax credit that is recorded as a reduction to the current tax expense.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??4.1.3.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The reductions to covered taxes of a constituent entity for the fiscal year is the sum of:\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 the amount of current tax expense with respect to income excluded from the computation of GloBE income or loss under Chapter 3;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 any amount of credit or refund other than qualified refundable tax credit and marketable transferable tax credit that is not recorded as a reduction to the current tax expense;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (c)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 any amount of covered taxes refunded or credited, except for any qualified refundable tax credit and marketable transferable tax credit, to a constituent entity that was not treated as an adjustment to current tax expense in the financial accounts;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (d)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 the amount of current tax expense which relates to an uncertain tax position; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (e)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 any amount of current tax expense that is not expected to be paid within three years of the last day of the fiscal year.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??4.1.4.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 No amount of covered taxes may be taken into account more than once.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??4.1.5.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 In a fiscal year in which there is no net GloBE income for a jurisdiction, if the adjusted covered taxes for a jurisdiction are less than zero and less than the expected adjusted covered taxes amount the constituent entities in that jurisdiction shall be treated as having additional current top-up tax for the jurisdiction under Article 5.4 arising in the current fiscal year equal to the difference between these amounts. The expected adjusted covered taxes amount is equal to the GloBE income or loss for a jurisdiction multiplied by the minimum rate.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Note\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa0\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 In relation to Article 4.1.5, see the specified OECD GloBE rules guidance in\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa0\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 paragraphs 21}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 .1 to 21.8 of Chapter 4 of the 2023 Commentary; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 section 2}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 .7 of the Feb-2023 Administrative Guidance.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\ql\sb240\sa80\keepn\li240\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li240\cf1 \f0 Article 4.2. Definition of covered taxes\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??4.2.1.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Covered taxes means:\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 taxes recorded in the financial accounts of a constituent entity with respect to its income or profits or its share of the income or profits of a constituent entity in which it owns an ownership interest;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 taxes on distributed profits, deemed profit distributions, and non-business expenses imposed under an eligible distribution tax system;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (c)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 taxes imposed in lieu of a generally applicable corporate income tax; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (d)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 taxes levied by reference to retained earnings and corporate equity, including a tax on multiple components based on income and equity.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??4.2.2.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Covered taxes does not include any amount of:\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 top-up tax accrued by a parent entity under a qualified IIR;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 top-up tax accrued by a constituent entity under a qualified domestic minimum top-up tax;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (c)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 taxes attributable to an adjustment made by a constituent entity as a result of the application of a qualified UTPR;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (d)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 a disqualified refundable imputation tax;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (e)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 taxes paid by an insurance company in respect of returns to policyholders.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\ql\sb240\sa80\keepn\li240\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li240\cf1 \f0 Article 4.3. Allocation of covered taxes from one constituent entity to another constituent entity\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??4.3.1.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Article 4.3.2 applies to the allocation of covered taxes in respect of permanent establishments, tax transparent entities and hybrid entities as well as the allocation of CFC taxes and taxes on distributions from one constituent entity to another.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??4.3.2.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Covered taxes are allocated from one constituent entity to another constituent entity as follows:\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 the amount of any covered taxes included in the financial accounts of a constituent entity with respect to GloBE income or loss of a permanent establishment is allocated to the permanent establishment;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 the amount of any covered taxes included in the financial accounts of a tax transparent entity with respect to GloBE income or loss allocated to a constituent entity-owner pursuant to Article 3.5.1(b) is allocated to that constituent entity-owner;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (c)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 in the case of a constituent entity whose constituent entity-owners are subject to a controlled foreign company tax regime, the amount of any covered taxes included in the financial accounts of its direct or indirect constituent entity-owners under a controlled foreign company tax regime on their share of the controlled foreign company\u8217??s income are allocated to the constituent entity;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (d)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 in the case of a constituent entity that is a hybrid entity the amount of any covered taxes included in the financial accounts of a constituent entity-owner on income of the hybrid entity is allocated to the hybrid entity; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (e)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 the amount of any covered taxes accrued in the financial accounts of a constituent entity\u8217??s direct constituent entity-owners on distributions from the constituent entity during the fiscal year are allocated to the distributing constituent entity.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Notes\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa0\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 1.\u160??\u160??}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 In relation to Article 4.3.2(c), see the specified OECD GloBE rules guidance in\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa0\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 paragraphs 58}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 .1 to 58.7 of Chapter 4 of the 2023 Commentary;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa0\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 section 2}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 .10 of the Feb-2023 Administrative Guidance; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa0\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (c)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 section 4}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0  of the Dec-2023 Administrative Guidance.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa0\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 2.\u160??\u160??}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 In relation to Article 4.3.2(e), see the specified OECD GloBE rules guidance in\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa0\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 paragraph 60}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 .1 of Chapter 4 of the 2023 Commentary; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa0\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 section 2}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 .6 of the Feb-2023 Administrative Guidance.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??4.3.3.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Covered taxes allocated to a constituent entity pursuant to Article 4.3.2(c) and (d) in respect of passive income are included in such constituent entity\u8217??s adjusted covered taxes in an amount equal to the lesser of:\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 the covered taxes allocated in respect of such passive income; or\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 the top-up tax percentage for the constituent entity\u8217??s jurisdiction, determined without regard to the taxes to be pushed down to the subsidiary under the controlled foreign company tax regime or fiscal transparency rule, multiplied by the amount of the constituent entity\u8217??s passive income includible under any controlled foreign company tax regime or fiscal transparency rule.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Any covered taxes of the constituent entity-owner incurred with respect to such passive income that remain after the application of this Article shall not be allocated under Article 4.3.2(c) or (d).\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??4.3.4.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Where the GloBE income of a permanent establishment is treated as GloBE income of the main entity pursuant to Article 3.4.5, any covered taxes arising in the location of the permanent establishment and associated with such income are treated as covered taxes of the main entity up to an amount not exceeding such income multiplied by the highest corporate tax rate on ordinary income in the jurisdiction where the main entity is located.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\ql\sb240\sa80\keepn\li240\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li240\cf1 \f0 Article 4.4. Mechanism to address temporary differences\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??4.4.1.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The total deferred tax adjustment amount for a constituent entity for the fiscal year is equal to the deferred tax expense accrued in its financial accounts if the applicable tax rate is below the minimum rate or, in any other case, such deferred tax expense recast at the minimum rate, with respect to covered taxes for the fiscal year subject to the adjustments set forth in Articles 4.4.2 and 4.4.3 and the following exclusions:\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 the amount of deferred tax expense with respect to items excluded from the computation of GloBE income or loss under Chapter 3;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 the amount of deferred tax expense with respect to disallowed accruals and unclaimed accruals;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (c)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 the impact of a valuation adjustment or accounting recognition adjustment with respect to a deferred tax asset;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (d)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 the amount of deferred tax expense arising from a re-measurement with respect to a change in the applicable domestic tax rate; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (e)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 the amount of deferred tax expense with respect to the generation and use of tax credits.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Notes\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa0\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 1.\u160??\u160??}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 In relation to Article 4.4.1, see the specified OECD GloBE rules guidance in\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa0\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 paragraphs 71}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 .1 to 71.3 of Chapter 4 of the 2023 Commentary; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa0\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 section 1}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 .3 of the Feb-2023 Administrative Guidance.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa0\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 2.\u160??\u160??}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 In relation to Article 4.4.1(e), see the specified OECD GloBE rules guidance in\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa0\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 paragraphs 82}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 .1 to 82.4 of Chapter 4 of the 2023 Commentary; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa0\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 section 2}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 .8 of the Feb-2023 Administrative Guidance.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??4.4.2.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The total deferred tax adjustment amount is adjusted as follows:\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 increased by the amount of unclaimed accrual paid during the fiscal year;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 increased by the amount of any recaptured deferred tax liability determined in a preceding fiscal year which has been paid during the fiscal year; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (c)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 reduced by the amount that would be a reduction to the total deferred tax adjustment amount due to recognition of a loss deferred tax asset for a current year tax loss, where a loss deferred tax asset has not been recognised because the recognition criteria are not met.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??4.4.3.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 A deferred tax asset that has been recorded at a rate lower than the minimum rate may be recast at the minimum rate in the fiscal year such deferred tax asset becomes a GloBE loss, if the taxpayer can demonstrate that the deferred tax asset is attributable to a GloBE loss. The total deferred tax adjustment amount is reduced by the amount that a deferred tax asset is increased due to being recast under this Article.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??4.4.4.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 To the extent a deferred tax liability, that is not a recapture exception accrual, is taken into account under this Article and such amount is not paid within the five subsequent fiscal years, the amount must be recaptured pursuant to this article. The amount of the recaptured deferred tax liability determined for the current fiscal year shall be treated as a reduction to covered taxes in the fifth preceding fiscal year and the effective tax rate and top-up tax of such fiscal year shall be recalculated under the rules of Article 5.4.1. The recaptured deferred tax liability for the current fiscal year is the amount of the increase in a category of deferred tax liability that was included in the total deferred tax adjustment amount in the fifth preceding fiscal year that has not reversed by the end of the last day of the current fiscal year, unless such amount relates to a recapture exception accrual as set forth in Article 4.4.5.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??4.4.5.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Recapture exception accrual means the tax expense accrued attributable to changes in associated deferred tax liabilities, in respect of:\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 cost recovery allowances on tangible assets;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 the cost of a licence or similar arrangement from the government for the use of immovable property or exploitation of natural resources that entails significant investment in tangible assets;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (c)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 research and development expenses;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (d)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 de-commissioning and remediation expenses;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (e)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 fair value accounting on unrealised net gains;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (f)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 foreign currency exchange net gains;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (g)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 insurance reserves and insurance policy deferred acquisition costs;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (h)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 gains from the sale of tangible property located in the same jurisdiction as the constituent entity that are reinvested in tangible property in the same jurisdiction; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (i)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 additional amounts accrued as a result of accounting principle changes with respect to categories (a) through (h).\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??4.4.6.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Disallowed accrual means:\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 any movement in deferred tax expense accrued in the financial accounts of a constituent entity which relates to an uncertain tax position; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 any movement in deferred tax expense accrued in the financial accounts of a constituent entity which relates to distributions from a constituent entity.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??4.4.7.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Unclaimed accrual means any increase in a deferred tax liability recorded in the financial accounts of a constituent entity for a fiscal year that is not expected to be paid within the time period set forth in Article 4.4.4 and for which the filing constituent entity makes an annual election not to include in total deferred tax adjustment amount for such fiscal year.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\ql\sb240\sa80\keepn\li240\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li240\cf1 \f0 Article 4.5. The GloBE loss election\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??4.5.1.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 In lieu of applying the rules set forth in Article 4.4, a filing constituent entity may make a GloBE loss election for a jurisdiction. When a GloBE loss election is made for a jurisdiction, a GloBE loss deferred tax asset is established in each fiscal year in which there is a net GloBE loss for the jurisdiction. The GloBE loss deferred tax asset is equal to the net GloBE loss in a fiscal year for the jurisdiction multiplied by the minimum rate.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??4.5.2.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The balance of the GloBE loss deferred tax asset is carried forward to subsequent fiscal years, reduced by the amount of GloBE loss deferred tax asset used in a fiscal year.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??4.5.3.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The GloBE loss deferred tax asset must be used in any subsequent fiscal year in which there is net GloBE income for the jurisdiction in an amount equal to the lower of the net GloBE income multiplied by the minimum rate or the amount of available GloBE loss deferred tax asset.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??4.5.4.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 If the GloBE loss election is subsequently revoked, any remaining GloBE loss deferred tax asset is reduced to zero, effective as of the first day of the first fiscal year in which the GloBE loss election is no longer applicable. Subsequently, the deferred tax assets and liabilities for the jurisdiction, if any, will be taken into account as if they had been calculated under Articles 4.4 and 9.1 for the prior fiscal year.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??4.5.5.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The GloBE loss election must be filed with the first GloBE information return of the MNE group for the first fiscal year in which the MNE group has a constituent entity located in the jurisdiction for which the election is made. A GloBE loss election cannot be made for a jurisdiction with an eligible distribution tax system as defined in Article 7.3.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??4.5.6.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 A flow-through entity that is a UPE of an MNE group may make a GloBE loss election under this Article. When such an election is made, the GloBE loss deferred tax asset shall be calculated in accordance with Articles 4.5.1 to 4.5.5, however, the GloBE loss deferred tax asset shall be calculated with reference to the GloBE loss of the flow-through entity after reduction in accordance with Article 7.1.2.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\ql\sb240\sa80\keepn\li240\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li240\cf1 \f0 Article 4.6. Post-filing adjustments and tax rate changes\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??4.6.1.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 An adjustment to a constituent entity\u8217??s liability for covered taxes for a previous fiscal year recorded in the financial accounts shall be treated as an adjustment to covered taxes in the fiscal year in which the adjustment is made, unless the adjustment relates to a fiscal year in which there is a decrease in covered taxes for the jurisdiction. In the case of a decrease in covered taxes included in the constituent entity\u8217??s adjusted covered taxes for a previous fiscal year, the effective tax rate and top-up tax for such fiscal year must be recalculated under Article 5.4.1. In the Article 5.4.1 recalculations, the adjusted covered taxes determined for the fiscal year shall be reduced by the amount of the decrease in covered taxes and GloBE income determined for the fiscal year and any intervening fiscal years shall be adjusted as necessary and appropriate. A filing constituent entity may make an annual election to treat an immaterial decrease in covered taxes as an adjustment to covered taxes in the fiscal year in which the adjustment is made. An immaterial decrease in covered taxes is an aggregate decrease of less than EUR 1 million in the adjusted covered taxes determined for the jurisdiction for a fiscal year.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Note\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 In relation to Article 4.6.1, see the specified OECD GloBE rules guidance in }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 paragraph 124}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  of Chapter 4 of the 2023 Commentary.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??4.6.2.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The amount of deferred tax expense resulting from a reduction to the applicable domestic tax rate shall be treated as an adjustment under Article 4.6.1 to a constituent entity\u8217??s liability for covered taxes claimed under Article 4.1 for a previous fiscal year when such reduction results in the application of a rate that is less than the minimum rate.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??4.6.3.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The amount of deferred tax expense, when paid, that has resulted from an increase to the applicable domestic tax rate shall be treated as an adjustment under Article 4.6.1 to a constituent entity\u8217??s liability for covered taxes claimed under Article 4.1 for a previous fiscal year when such amount was originally recorded at a rate less than the minimum rate. This adjustment is limited to an amount that is equal to an increase of deferred tax expense up to such deferred tax expense recast at the minimum rate.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??4.6.4.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 If more than EUR 1 million of the amount accrued by a constituent entity as current tax expense and included in adjusted covered taxes for a fiscal year is not paid within three years of the last day of such year, the effective tax rate and top-up tax for the fiscal year in which the unpaid amount was claimed as a covered tax must be recalculated in accordance with Article 5.4.1 by excluding such unpaid amount from adjusted covered taxes.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs28\ql\sb240\sa80\keepn\li240\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs28\ql\ql\li240\cf1 \f0 Chapter 5 Computation of Effective Tax Rate and Top-up Tax\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\ql\sb240\sa80\keepn\li240\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li240\cf1 \f0 Article 5.1. Determination of effective tax rate\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??5.1.1.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The effective tax rate of the MNE group for a jurisdiction with net GloBE income shall be calculated for each fiscal year. The effective tax rate of the MNE group for a jurisdiction is equal to the sum of the adjusted covered taxes of each constituent entity located in the jurisdiction divided by the net GloBE income of the jurisdiction for the fiscal year. For purposes of Chapter 5, each stateless constituent entity shall be treated as a single constituent entity located in a separate jurisdiction.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Note\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 In relation to Article 5.1.1, see the specified OECD GloBE rules guidance in }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 paragraphs 6}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  and }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 7}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0  of Chapter 5 of the 2023 Commentary.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??5.1.2.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The net GloBE income of a jurisdiction for a fiscal year is the positive amount, if any, computed in accordance with the following formula:\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs2\qj\sb0\sa0\li720\sl20{\par}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs2\qj\sb0\sa0\li720\sl20{{\pard\intbl\ltrch\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\intbl\b0\i0\fs22\qr\sb0\sa80\li0\sl0{{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qr\qr\li0\cf1 \f0 N}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qr\qr\li0\cf1 \f0 et GloBE }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qr\qr\li0\cf1 \f0 I}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qr\qr\li0\cf1 \f0 ncome\cell}}\pard\intbl\ltrch\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\intbl\b0\i0\fs22\qc\sb0\sa80\li0\sl0{{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 =\cell}}\pard\intbl\ltrch\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\intbl\b0\i0\fs22\qc\sb0\sa80\li0\sl0{{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 GloBE }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 I}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 ncome of all }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 C}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 onstituent }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 E}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 ntities\cell}}\pard\intbl\ltrch\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\intbl\b0\i0\fs22\qc\sb0\sa80\li0\sl0{{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qc\qc\li0\cf1 \f0 \u8211??\cell}}\pard\intbl\ltrch\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\intbl\b0\i0\fs22\ql\sb0\sa80\li0\sl0{{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\ql\ql\li0\cf1 \f0 GloBE }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\ql\ql\li0\cf1 \f0 L}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\ql\ql\li0\cf1 \f0 osses of all }{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\ql\ql\li0\cf1 \f0 C}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\ql\ql\li0\cf1 \f0 onstitue}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\ql\ql\li0\cf1 \f0 n}{\b0\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\ql\ql\li0\cf1 \f0 t Entities\cell}}{
