ibutable to a recalculation under the Article 5.4.1 and the jurisdiction does not have net GloBE income for the current fiscal year, top-up tax shall be allocated using the formula in Article 5.2.4 based on the GloBE income of the constituent entities in the fiscal years for which the recalculations under Article 5.4.1 were performed.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\ql\sb240\sa80\keepn\li240\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li240\cf1 \f0 Article 5.3. Substance-based income exclusion\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??5.3.1.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The net GloBE income for the jurisdiction shall be reduced by the substance-based income exclusion for the jurisdiction to determine the excess profit for purposes of computing the top-up tax under Article 5.2. A filing constituent entity of an MNE group may make an annual election not to apply the substance-based income exclusion for a jurisdiction by not computing the exclusion or claiming it in the computation of top-up tax for the jurisdiction in the GloBE information return(s) filed for the fiscal year.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Note\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa0\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 In relation to Article 5.3.1, see the specified OECD GloBE rules guidance in\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa0\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 paragraph 29}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 .1 of Chapter 5 of the 2023 Commentary; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 section 3}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0  of the Jul-2023 Administrative Guidance.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??5.3.2.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The substance-based income exclusion amount for a jurisdiction is the sum of the payroll carve-out and the tangible asset carve-out for each constituent entity, except for constituent entities that are investment-related entities, in that jurisdiction.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??5.3.3.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The payroll carve-out for a constituent entity located in a jurisdiction is equal to 5% of its eligible payroll costs of eligible employees that perform activities for the MNE group in such jurisdiction, except eligible payroll costs that are:\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 capitalised and included in the carrying value of eligible tangible assets;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 attributable to a constituent entity\u8217??s international shipping income and qualified ancillary international shipping income under Article 3.3.5 that is excluded from the computation of GloBE income or loss for the fiscal year.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Note\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa0\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 In relation to Article 5.3.3, see\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa0\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 the specified OECD GloBE rules guidance in\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa0\fi-1080\li2160\tqr\tx1920\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 (i)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 paragraph 36}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 .1 of Chapter 5 of the 2023 Commentary; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa0\fi-1080\li2160\tqr\tx1920\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 (ii)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 section 3}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0  of the Jul-2023 Administrative Guidance; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa0\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 the specified OECD GloBE rules guidance in\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa0\fi-1080\li2160\tqr\tx1920\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 (i)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 paragraphs 33}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0  and }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 33}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 .1 of Chapter 5 of the 2023 Commentary; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa0\fi-1080\li2160\tqr\tx1920\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 (ii)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0 section 3}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li2160\cf1 \f0  of the Jul-2023 Administrative Guidance.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??5.3.4.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The tangible asset carve-out for a constituent entity located in a jurisdiction is equal to 5% of the carrying value of eligible tangible assets located in such jurisdiction. Eligible tangible assets means:\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 property, plant, and equipment located in that jurisdiction;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 natural resources located in that jurisdiction;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (c)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 a lessee\u8217??s right of use of tangible assets located in that jurisdiction; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (d)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 a licence or similar arrangement from the government for the use of immovable property or exploitation of natural resources that entails significant investment in tangible assets.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 For this purpose, the tangible asset carve-out computation shall not include the carrying value of property (including land or buildings) that is held for sale, lease or investment. The tangible asset carve-out computation shall not include the carrying value of tangible assets used in the generation of a constituent entity\u8217??s international shipping income and qualified ancillary international shipping income (i.e. ships and other maritime equipment and infrastructure). The carrying value of tangible assets attributable to a constituent entity\u8217??s excess income over the cap for qualified ancillary international shipping income under Article 3.3.4 shall be included in the tangible asset carve-out computation.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa80\li720\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Note\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa0\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 In relation to Article 5.3.4, see\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa0\fi-10