\brdrcf1\brdrcf1\brdrcf1\brdrcf1\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf1\clpadl0\clpadfl3\clpadt100\clpadft3\clpadb0\clpadfb3\clpadr100\clpadfr3\clshdrawnil\cltxlrtb\clftsWidth2\clwWidth2500\clNoWrap\cellx9386\row}}}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\ql\sb240\sa80\keepn\li240\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li240\cf1 \f0 Article 9.3. Exclusion from the UTPR of MNE groups in the initial phase of their international activity\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??9.3.1.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 Subject to Article 9.3.4 the top-up tax that would otherwise be taken into account under Article 2.5.1 shall be reduced to zero during the initial phase of an MNE group\u8217??s international activity, notwithstanding the requirements otherwise provided in Chapter 5.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??9.3.2.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 For the purposes of Article 9.3, an MNE group is in its initial phase of its international activity if, for a fiscal year:\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 it has constituent entities in no more than six jurisdictions; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 the sum of the net book values of tangible assets of all constituent entities located in all jurisdictions other than the reference jurisdiction does not exceed EUR 50 million.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??9.3.3.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 For the purposes of Article 9.3.2, the reference jurisdiction of an MNE group is the jurisdiction where the MNE group has the highest total value of tangible assets for the fiscal year in which the MNE group originally comes within the scope of the GloBE rules. The total value of tangible assets in a jurisdiction is the sum of the net book values of all tangible assets of all the constituent entities of the MNE group that are located in that jurisdiction.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??9.3.4.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 This Article 9.3 shall not apply for any fiscal year that starts later than five years after the first day of the first fiscal year when the MNE group originally came within the scope of the GloBE rules. For MNE groups that are in scope of the GloBE rules when they come into effect, the period of five years will start at the time the UTPR rules come into effect.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \u160??\u160??9.3.5.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 If Hong Kong is the reference jurisdiction of the MNE group pursuant to Article 9.3.3, then Article 9.3.1 shall not apply during the initial phase of that MNE group\u8217??s international activity and, during that initial phase:\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 the top-up tax calculated for a low-taxed constituent entity that would be taken into account under Article 2.5.1 shall be reduced to zero if that low-taxed constituent entity is located in the reference jurisdiction, notwithstanding the requirements otherwise provided in Chapter 5; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1200\tqr\tx960\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 the UTPR percentage of the jurisdictions other than the reference jurisdiction is deemed to be zero.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\ql\sb240\sa80\keepn\li240\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li240\cf1 \f0 Article 9.4. Transitional relief for filing obligations\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\li240\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li240\cf1 \f0 [Article 9.4 of the OECD GloBE model rules is omitted. See, instead, }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li240\cf1 \f0 Part 2 of Schedule 63}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li240\cf1 \f0  for provisions on transitional relief for filing obligations.]\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs28\ql\sb240\sa80\keepn\li240\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs28\ql\ql\li240\cf1 \f0 Chapter 10 Definitions\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b\i0\fs22\ql\sb240\sa80\keepn\li240\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\ql\ql\li240\cf1 \f0 Article 10.1. Defined terms\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb240\sa80\fi-720\li720\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 10.1.1.}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li720\cf1 \f0 The terms set out below have the following definitions:\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-480\li1200\sl260{{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Acceptable financial accounting standard}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  (}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f13\u21487??\u25509??\u21463??\u30340??\u36001??\u21209??\u26371??\u35336??\u28310??\u21063??}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ) means International Financial Reporting Standards (IFRS) and the generally accepted accounting principles of Australia, Brazil, Canada, Member States of the European Union, Member States of the European Economic Area, Hong Kong (China), Japan, Mexico, New Zealand, the People\u8217??s Republic of China, the Republic of India, the Republic of Korea, Russia, Singapore, Switzerland, the United Kingdom, and the United States of America.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-480\li1200\sl260{{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Accrued pension expense}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  (}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f13\u32047??\u31639??\u36864??\u20241??\u37329??\u38283??\u25903??}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 )}{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 means the difference between the amount of pension liability expense included in the financial accounting net income or loss and the amount contributed to a pension fund for the fiscal year.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-480\li1200\sl260{{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Additional current top-up tax}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  (}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f13\u38989??\u22806??\u30070??\u26399??\u35036??\u36275??\u31237??}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ) is the amount of tax determined in Article 5.4 and any amount treated as additional current top-up tax determined under Article 5.4, such as the amount determined under Article 4.1.5 or Article 7.3.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-480\li1200\sl260{{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Additional tier one capital}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  (}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f13\u38989??\u22806??\u19968??\u32026??\u36039??\u26412??}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ) means an instrument issued by a constituent entity pursuant to prudential regulatory requirements applicable to the banking sector that is convertible to equity or written down if a pre-specified trigger event occurs and that has other features which are designed to aid loss absorbency in the event of a financial crisis.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-480\li1200\sl260{{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Additions to covered taxes}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  (}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f13\u28085??\u33995??\u31237??\u22686??\u21152??\u38989??}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ) is defined in Article 4.1.2.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-480\li1200\sl260{{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Adjusted asset gain}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  (}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f13\u32147??\u35519??\u25972??\u36039??\u29986??\u25910??\u30410??}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ) in respect of aggregate asset gain that is subject to an election under Article 3.2.6 means an amount equal to the aggregate asset gain in the election year, reduced by any amount of such gain that has been applied against the net asset loss in a prior loss year under Article 3.2.6(b) or (c).\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-480\li1200\sl260{{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Adjusted covered taxes}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  (}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f13\u32147??\u35519??\u25972??\u28085??\u33995??\u31237??}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ) is defined in Article 4.1.1.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-480\li1200\sl260{{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Aggregate asset gain}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  (}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f13\u32317??\u36039??\u29986??\u25910??\u30410??}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ) in respect of an election under Article 3.2.6, means the net gain in the election year from the disposition of local tangible assets by all constituent entities located in the jurisdiction excluding the gain or loss on a transfer of assets between group members.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-480\li1200\sl260{{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Agreed administrative guidance}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  (}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f13\u12298??\u21332??\u23450??\u34892??\u25919??\u25351??\u24341??\u12299??}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ) means guidance on the interpretation or administration of the GloBE rules issued by the Inclusive Framework.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-480\li1200\sl260{{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Allocable share of the top-up tax}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  (}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f13\u35036??\u36275??\u31237??\u20013??\u30340??\u21487??\u20998??\u37197??\u20221??\u38989??}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ) is defined in Article 2.2.1.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-480\li1200\sl260{{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Annual election}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  (}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f13\u24180??\u24230??\u36984??\u25799??}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ) means an election made by a filing constituent entity and that applies only for the fiscal year for which the election is made.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-480\li1200\sl260{{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Allocated asset gain}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  (}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f13\u29554??\u20998??\u37197??\u36039??\u29986??\u25910??\u30410??}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ) in respect of an election under Article 3.2.6, means the adjusted asset gain that is allocated to a fiscal year in the lookback period under Article 3.2.6(d).\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-480\li1200\sl260{{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Arm\u8217??s length principle}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  (}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f13\u29544??\u31435??\u20132??\u26131??\u21407??\u21063??}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ) means the principle under which transactions between constituent entities must be recorded by reference to the conditions that would have been obtained between independent enterprises in comparable transactions and under comparable circumstances.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-480\li1200\sl260{{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Asymmetric foreign currency gains or losses}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  (}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f13\u38750??\u23565??\u31281??\u21295??\u20812??\u25613??\u30410??}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ) means foreign currency gains or losses of an entity whose accounting and tax functional currencies are different and that are:\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 included in the computation of a constituent entity\u8217??s taxable income or loss and attributable to fluctuations in the exchange rate between its accounting functional currency and its tax functional currency;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 included in the computation of a constituent entity\u8217??s financial accounting net income or loss and attributable to fluctuations in the exchange rate between its tax functional currency and its accounting functional currency;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (c)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 included in the computation of a constituent entity\u8217??s financial accounting net income or loss and attributable to fluctuations in the exchange rate between a third foreign currency and its accounting functional currency; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (d)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 attributable to fluctuations in the exchange rate between a third foreign currency and its tax functional currency, whether or not such foreign currency gain or loss is included in taxable income.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\li1200\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 The tax functional currency is the functional currency used to determine the constituent entity\u8217??s taxable income or loss for a covered tax in the jurisdiction in which it is located. The accounting functional currency is the functional currency used to determine the constituent entity\u8217??s financial accounting net income or loss. A third foreign currency is a currency that is not the constituent entity\u8217??s tax functional currency or accounting functional currency.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-480\li1200\sl260{{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Authorised accounting body}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  (}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f13\u29554??\u35469??\u21487??\u26371??\u35336??\u22296??\u39636??}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ) is the body with legal authority in a jurisdiction to prescribe, establish, or accept accounting standards for financial reporting purposes.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-480\li1200\sl260{{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Authorised financial accounting standard}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  (}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f13\u29554??\u35469??\u21487??\u36001??\u21209??\u26371??\u35336??\u28310??\u21063??}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ), in respect of any entity, means a set of generally acceptable accounting principles permitted by an authorised accounting body in t