ntity or group, means an entity that is a member of the same group.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-480\li1200\sl260{{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 High-tax counterparty}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  (}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f13\u39640??\u31237??\u23565??\u25163??\u26041??}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ) means a constituent entity that is located in a jurisdiction that is not a low-tax jurisdiction or that is located in a jurisdiction that would not be a low-tax jurisdiction if its ETR were determined without regard to any income or expense accrued by that entity in respect of an intragroup financing arrangement.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-480\li1200\sl260{{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 IFRS}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  means the International Financial Reporting Standards.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-480\li1200\sl260{{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 IIR}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  (}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f13\u25910??\u20837??\u32013??\u20837??\u35215??\u21063??}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ) means the rules set out in Article 2.1 to Article 2.3.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-480\li1200\sl260{{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Included revaluation method gain or loss}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  (}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f13\u21015??\u20837??\u37325??\u20272??\u26041??\u27861??\u30340??\u25613??\u30410??}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ) means the net gain or loss, increased or decreased by any associated covered taxes, for the fiscal year in respect of all property, plant and equipment that arises under an accounting method or practice that:\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (a)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 periodically adjusts the carrying value of such property to its fair value;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (b)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 records the changes in value in other comprehensive income; and\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-1080\li1680\tqr\tx1440\sl260{\tab{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 (c)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 does not subsequently report the gains or losses recorded in other comprehensive income through profit and loss.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-480\li1200\sl260{{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Insurance investment entity}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  (}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f13\u20445??\u38570??\u25237??\u36039??\u23526??\u39636??}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ) means an entity that would meet the definition of an investment fund or a real estate investment vehicle except that it is established in relation to liabilities under an insurance or annuity contract and is wholly-owned by an entity that is subject to regulation in its location as an insurance company.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa80\li1200\sl260{{\b\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs18\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Note\u8212??\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs18\qj\sb0\sa80\