(e)}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 \tab }{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1680\cf1 \f0 upon termination, liquidation or dissolution of the entity, all of its assets must be distributed or revert to a non-profit organisation or to the government (including any governmental entity) of the entity\u8217??s jurisdiction of residence or any political subdivision thereof;\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\li1200\sl260{{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 but does not include any entity carrying on a trade or business that is not directly related to the purposes for which it was established.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-480\li1200\sl260{{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Non-qualified refundable tax credit}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  (}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f13\u19981??\u21512??\u36039??\u26684??\u21487??\u36864??\u36996??\u31237??\u25910??\u25269??\u20813??}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ) means a tax credit that is not a qualified refundable tax credit but that is refundable in whole or in part.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-480\li1200\sl260{{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Non-qualifying gain or loss}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  (}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f13\u19981??\u21512??\u36039??\u26684??\u30340??\u25613??\u30410??}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ) means the lesser of the gain or loss of the disposing constituent entity arising in connection with a GloBE reorganisation that is subject to tax in the disposing constituent entity\u8217??s location and the financial accounting gain or loss arising in connection with the GloBE reorganisation.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-480\li1200\sl260{{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Number of employees}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  (}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f13\u20721??\u21729??\u20154??\u25976??}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ), for the purposes of the UTPR percentage, means the total number of employees on a full-time equivalent (FTE) basis of all the constituent entities resident for tax purposes in the relevant tax jurisdiction. For this purpose, independent contractors participating in the ordinary operating activities of the constituent entity are reported as employees. With regard to permanent establishments, employees should be allocated to the tax jurisdiction in which the permanent establishment is located when the payroll costs of such employees are included in the separate financial accounts of that permanent establishment as determined by Article 3.4.1 and adjusted in accordance with 3.4.2. The number of employees attributed to the tax jurisdiction of a permanent establishment shall not be taken into account for the number of employees of the tax jurisdiction of the main entity.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-480\li1200\sl260{{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 OECD Model Tax Convention}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  (}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f13\u12298??\u32147??\u21512??\u32068??\u32340??\u31237??\u25910??\u21332??\u23450??\u31684??\u26412??\u12299??}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 ) means the OECD (2017), Model Tax Convention on Income and on Capital: Condensed Version 2017, OECD Publishing, Paris, https://doi.org/10.1787/mtc_cond-2017-en.\par }}\pard\plain\nosnaplinegrid\b0\i0\fs22\qj\sb0\sa80\fi-480\li1200\sl260{{\b\i\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0 Other comprehensive income}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\li1200\cf1 \f0  (}{\b0\i0\nosupersub\nosupersub\fs22\qj\qj\